1
00:00:01,250 --> 00:02:03,650
Visit our website for more: turkision.com

2
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:08,560
No living being was harmed
during the filming of this series

3
00:02:08,990 --> 00:02:11,550
Episode 115

4
00:02:11,710 --> 00:02:13,150
Go away, Osman Bey!

5
00:02:13,150 --> 00:02:14,270
You will stop.

6
00:02:15,550 --> 00:02:17,460
If the blood that shed was yours...

7
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:18,860
would you stop?

8
00:02:18,890 --> 00:02:21,080
I would definitely stop!

9
00:02:21,270 --> 00:02:22,470
I would definitely stop.

10
00:02:23,010 --> 00:02:25,460
If you move without
knowing the truth...

11
00:02:25,460 --> 00:02:27,590
other people's blood will be shed.

12
00:02:48,490 --> 00:02:49,880
Karesi Bey

13
00:02:54,390 --> 00:02:55,940
I know.

14
00:02:56,610 --> 00:02:58,940
I know your pain is great.
(I know you're sorry.)

15
00:02:58,980 --> 00:03:00,430
I understand you well.

16
00:03:00,910 --> 00:03:02,340
But you have to stop.

17
00:03:05,930 --> 00:03:08,750
You took the person I
considered my son from me.

18
00:03:08,780 --> 00:03:09,960
Please, Beys!

19
00:03:09,990 --> 00:03:11,670
Stop, Beys!

20
00:03:11,740 --> 00:03:15,920
In difficult times like these, unity
is necessary.

21
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:17,440
Karesi Bey.

22
00:03:18,170 --> 00:03:19,280
Karesi Bey.

23
00:03:21,300 --> 00:03:23,030
You talk about the truth.

24
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:24,700
The truth!

25
00:03:25,820 --> 00:03:31,540
I'll just stop until the truth comes out.

26
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:37,010
I will stop.

27
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:40,900
Alps!

28
00:03:41,480 --> 00:03:44,640
Arrest Osman Bey's nephew.

29
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:47,240
You're making a
mistake, Karesi Bey.

30
00:03:47,270 --> 00:03:50,090
While there are all these mistakes...

31
00:03:50,260 --> 00:03:53,020
Let me make another one,
is that too much?

32
00:03:57,180 --> 00:03:59,180
I will leave him alive.

33
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:01,500
I will control my anger.

34
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:06,160
I will not kill Aktemur, but I
will arrest him.

35
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:10,400
Don't ask me for
more than that, Osman Bey.

36
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,630
Karesi Bey.

37
00:04:12,250 --> 00:04:15,620
I tell you that I vouch for my nephew
and you still insist on his arrest!

38
00:04:15,769 --> 00:04:18,100
Don't fall for these games.

39
00:04:18,209 --> 00:04:20,319
They do this in
order to spoil our unity.

40
00:04:20,339 --> 00:04:21,880
Don't fall for these tricks.

41
00:04:21,880 --> 00:04:24,620
I don't care about the unity.

42
00:04:26,020 --> 00:04:27,450
It can be fixed anyway.

43
00:04:27,890 --> 00:04:29,430
But my son-in-law...

44
00:04:29,820 --> 00:04:32,790
My son-in-law cannot be
returned, Osman Bey.

45
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:34,800
Get out of my way.

46
00:04:43,340 --> 00:04:46,810
No one will wield their sword until
an order comes from within, Alps.

47
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:50,580
If they don't fight us, we won't
fight them, Konur.

48
00:04:51,550 --> 00:04:54,830
You draw swords where you are guests.

49
00:04:55,180 --> 00:04:57,070
We draw them
until things clear up.

50
00:04:57,290 --> 00:05:00,500
When things clear up, we'll
break them if needed.

51
00:05:24,210 --> 00:05:25,500
Take him.

52
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:42,270
If you are Osman's nephew...

53
00:05:42,440 --> 00:05:44,650
You will be jailed.

54
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:51,050
I hope it turns out that it is a game of
the enemy, as you said, Osman Bey.

55
00:05:51,770 --> 00:05:55,850
Otherwise, if it turns out that
Aktemur is the guilty one...

56
00:05:55,850 --> 00:05:58,940
there will be no
agreement or unity between us.

57
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,630
You should know that.

58
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:08,710
But if it turns out that you
are the one behind this...

59
00:06:10,760 --> 00:06:14,890
Then no one will leave my land alive.

60
00:06:16,970 --> 00:06:20,540
I'm not someone who would kill
your son-in-law...

61
00:06:22,580 --> 00:06:25,120
And I'm not the one to plan
games behind your back.

62
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:30,560
I see your pain.

63
00:06:32,590 --> 00:06:34,450
Because I see your pain...

64
00:06:34,630 --> 00:06:37,040
I will ignore your threat.

65
00:06:38,070 --> 00:06:40,080
These lands are definitely yours.

66
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,630
But learn this...

67
00:06:43,690 --> 00:06:48,950
In these lands, it is not clear whose
head will be cut off.

68
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:52,080
Try, Osman Bey, try.

69
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:54,640
I am not a man who is afraid.

70
00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:02,030
Who knows the truth
is never afraid of death.

71
00:07:03,190 --> 00:07:04,550
But look...

72
00:07:05,050 --> 00:07:07,470
I did not draw my
sword in your face.

73
00:07:11,950 --> 00:07:13,270
Karesi Bey.

74
00:07:14,530 --> 00:07:17,210
I will face those oppressors, you
and me together.

75
00:07:18,150 --> 00:07:19,780
Then you will see...

76
00:07:21,630 --> 00:07:23,300
I take you on my side.

77
00:07:23,380 --> 00:07:25,020
I consider you one of us.

78
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:29,670
You will see the truth.

79
00:07:32,060 --> 00:07:34,130
Then, you will ask me for forgiveness.

80
00:07:46,280 --> 00:07:47,640
Beys.

81
00:08:02,530 --> 00:08:04,190
What is happening here?

82
00:08:14,750 --> 00:08:17,590
You tried to act without me again.

83
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:23,620
You smeared the place with blood.

84
00:08:53,270 --> 00:08:54,940
Do you feel this, Orhan Bey?

85
00:08:55,420 --> 00:08:56,910
I don't feel anything.

86
00:09:04,160 --> 00:09:05,390
In the name of Allah.

87
00:09:15,910 --> 00:09:16,660
Like a stone.

88
00:09:17,310 --> 00:09:19,240
My body is like a stone, Kumral Abdal.

89
00:09:38,860 --> 00:09:40,420
Don't be afraid, son.

90
00:09:40,730 --> 00:09:42,220
You will recover.

91
00:09:43,730 --> 00:09:45,670
I got up, mother.

92
00:09:46,100 --> 00:09:47,630
My arm was fine.

93
00:09:47,910 --> 00:09:49,130
But now...

94
00:09:50,310 --> 00:09:52,470
Now, I can't feel any part of my body.

95
00:09:58,130 --> 00:09:59,700
Mother.

96
00:10:00,290 --> 00:10:01,780
Say something.

97
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:04,380
Will I never get up again?

98
00:10:04,690 --> 00:10:08,260
No, my dear Orhan, you will heal.
You will stand up again.

99
00:10:11,860 --> 00:10:13,020
We are here, dear Orhan.

100
00:10:14,230 --> 00:10:15,480
Rest a little

101
00:10:26,460 --> 00:10:27,540
Poison.

102
00:10:28,750 --> 00:10:31,860
It won't kill him, but it makes
him weak.

103
00:10:34,270 --> 00:10:36,370
What are you saying, Kumral Abdal?

104
00:10:36,740 --> 00:10:39,350
Will Orhan not
get up again?

105
00:10:45,370 --> 00:10:47,120
Do not say this, Kumral Abdal.

106
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:49,200
Is there no cure for this?

107
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:53,040
Can't you do anything?

108
00:11:07,210 --> 00:11:09,350
I would raise armies.

109
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:14,200
I would complete my father's call.

110
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:23,310
With this helpless foot,
which state will I conquer?

111
00:11:24,540 --> 00:11:26,040
With these arms...

112
00:11:27,370 --> 00:11:30,020
On which oppressor will I draw my sword?

113
00:11:34,130 --> 00:11:38,060
I'm dead,
I'm dead now.

114
00:11:47,460 --> 00:11:50,470
You are not dead, my brother

115
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:53,500
You will live.

116
00:11:55,760 --> 00:11:58,310
I will become your foot if your
foot does not move...

117
00:11:58,340 --> 00:12:01,280
and I will become your
hand if your hand does not move.

118
00:12:01,310 --> 00:12:02,590
But you will live.

119
00:12:28,660 --> 00:12:29,690
Karesi Bey.

120
00:12:30,060 --> 00:12:32,880
I have known Osman Bey for a long time.

121
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:37,320
He is a disobedient and stubborn person.

122
00:12:40,140 --> 00:12:43,310
But he is not a Bey who does this
in a place where he is a guest.

123
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:46,420
He is not the one
who did this, Mother Sultan.

124
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:48,460
His nephew Aktemur...

125
00:12:48,900 --> 00:12:52,810
argued with Uslu, my son-in-law...

126
00:12:53,010 --> 00:12:55,840
- then, at night...
- He didn't do it.

127
00:13:01,220 --> 00:13:03,530
I know the traitor who did this.

128
00:13:10,630 --> 00:13:17,140
His intention is to divide
you and us with sedition.

129
00:13:21,390 --> 00:13:25,170
This traitor who come between us...

130
00:13:32,020 --> 00:13:34,840
is now with us.

131
00:13:42,780 --> 00:13:43,980
Who is he, Mother Sultan?

132
00:13:45,630 --> 00:13:46,690
While he...

133
00:13:51,930 --> 00:13:54,590
is can't even be prey...

134
00:13:55,510 --> 00:13:57,980
he tried to be a hunter.

135
00:14:03,260 --> 00:14:04,610
Mother Sultan.

136
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:10,240
You dog!

137
00:14:23,950 --> 00:14:25,340
What is your evidence?

138
00:14:26,780 --> 00:14:30,270
Although the situation
exonerates you and your nephew...

139
00:14:30,530 --> 00:14:32,610
why do you
ask for evidence, Osman Bey?

140
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:36,250
We are not looking for innocence,
we are looking for the truth

141
00:14:37,970 --> 00:14:39,450
Tell me now.

142
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:43,850
What is the relationship between the blood
that was spilled in this palace and Avcı?

143
00:14:45,030 --> 00:14:46,220
Osman Bey.

144
00:14:47,820 --> 00:14:52,440
You are asking for evidence,
then I will prove it.

145
00:14:56,580 --> 00:14:57,790
Celali.

146
00:15:14,470 --> 00:15:15,910
If you want proof...

147
00:15:18,280 --> 00:15:19,340
look at the dead.

148
00:16:04,730 --> 00:16:06,470
Both contain the seal
of the Mongols.

149
00:16:07,270 --> 00:16:11,080
You collaborate with
dogs and kill my nephew?

150
00:16:11,800 --> 00:16:13,340
You will die like dogs.

151
00:16:13,580 --> 00:16:16,120
You will remain calm, Karesi Bey.

152
00:16:18,130 --> 00:16:19,560
The traitor betrayed me.

153
00:16:20,620 --> 00:16:22,980
And justice is my justice.

154
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:27,860
He will die like a dog.

155
00:16:31,520 --> 00:16:32,840
Do not worry.

156
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:34,870
Then he will be questioned.

157
00:16:35,220 --> 00:16:38,680
If it takes to interrogate a dog
I've had all these years...

158
00:16:39,580 --> 00:16:40,790
I will interrogate him.

159
00:16:50,520 --> 00:16:51,680
Take him.

160
00:17:12,858 --> 00:17:14,020
He died, my Sultan.

161
00:17:17,190 --> 00:17:18,710
Nobody needs to worry.

162
00:17:19,940 --> 00:17:24,410
There is justice in where I am.

163
00:17:48,300 --> 00:17:51,870
Let this be the last thing
you don't depend on me, Karesi Bey.

164
00:17:53,690 --> 00:17:57,610
Next time, I'll make you hurt.

165
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:08,210
Take your corpse.

166
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:13,770
Let's go now, we have important
matters to discuss.

167
00:18:49,030 --> 00:18:50,160
Brothers.

168
00:18:50,460 --> 00:18:52,070
What's going on
here, brother?

169
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:55,460
Brother, this isn't the time for questions
now, we're in a hurry.

170
00:18:55,600 --> 00:18:57,610
You and Aykut will follow Avcı.

171
00:18:58,840 --> 00:19:01,720
The place where the dead goes is
known, my brother, it is the cemetery.

172
00:19:01,800 --> 00:19:05,040
Yes brother, just follow him, my Bey
clearly suspects something.

173
00:19:05,500 --> 00:19:09,020
If there's something
behind this, we'll find it.

174
00:19:09,240 --> 00:19:10,270
Come on, brother.

175
00:19:10,470 --> 00:19:11,740
Come on, be careful.

176
00:19:14,320 --> 00:19:20,140
Does Naiman have so much power that
he can kill my son-in-law in my palace?

177
00:19:20,600 --> 00:19:26,060
He is so powerful that he
buys the helper...

178
00:19:26,995 --> 00:19:29,765
who has been at Sultan Aladdin's
mother's side for years.

179
00:19:30,490 --> 00:19:34,270
In short, the matter is
greater than the late Uslu Bey.

180
00:19:37,660 --> 00:19:42,060
If we do not unite, and stand
up to the oppressor...

181
00:19:43,370 --> 00:19:44,850
Thousands will die like him.

182
00:19:51,360 --> 00:19:52,700
Isn't it, Osman Bey?

183
00:19:53,450 --> 00:19:55,700
We are here for that.

184
00:19:58,910 --> 00:20:01,080
Karesi Bey and I
have agreed...

185
00:20:04,620 --> 00:20:06,410
And Candar Bey is behind us.

186
00:20:07,760 --> 00:20:14,330
Yakup Bey, ruler of the Germiyanids, who
has the largest army in these lands...

187
00:20:14,815 --> 00:20:15,815
stands behind me.

188
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:27,840
That is why you will stand behind me.

189
00:20:31,490 --> 00:20:32,860
Karesi Bey.

190
00:20:34,040 --> 00:20:35,450
Osman Bey.

191
00:20:36,620 --> 00:20:38,820
It won't be easy for you both.

192
00:20:41,930 --> 00:20:47,010
Osman Bey made a great effort
to convince me and Candar Bey.

193
00:20:49,620 --> 00:20:51,560
He gave me his property.

194
00:20:53,500 --> 00:20:56,240
- Instead of being satisfied...
- No...

195
00:21:00,560 --> 00:21:02,580
We do nothing for ourselves.

196
00:21:06,090 --> 00:21:09,300
While there is a calamity coming upon us...

197
00:21:09,385 --> 00:21:13,925
we never care
who will have the leadership role.

198
00:21:16,290 --> 00:21:19,550
As Yakup Bey, son
of Germiyanids...

199
00:21:19,690 --> 00:21:23,180
who says that he can solve
problems with gold...

200
00:21:23,430 --> 00:21:25,110
accepts the war...

201
00:21:38,700 --> 00:21:41,500
Then, we will accept to
stand behind Mother Sultan.

202
00:21:48,740 --> 00:21:50,760
Can I believe you?

203
00:21:51,390 --> 00:21:52,650
Mother Sultan.

204
00:21:54,460 --> 00:21:58,350
Naiman is coming to our lands with
about forty thousand Mongol soldiers.

205
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:03,050
None of the Bey
wanted to fight this war.

206
00:22:04,610 --> 00:22:07,240
I called them to battle.

207
00:22:11,220 --> 00:22:17,290
But now, I see
that the Beys agree to fight.

208
00:22:20,240 --> 00:22:24,960
If our army is going to win this war, it
doesn't matter who will be in command.

209
00:22:27,960 --> 00:22:30,320
You amaze us, Osman Bey.

210
00:22:35,380 --> 00:22:41,710
Who will be surprised is Naiman,
as will be defeated in this war.

211
00:22:47,140 --> 00:22:52,640
So, you are invited to the council of
war that I will hold in Yenişehir.

212
00:22:55,940 --> 00:23:00,400
We will talk about the army that we will
establish and our war campaigns there.

213
00:23:01,320 --> 00:23:03,730
Of course, we will be
there, Mother Sultan.

214
00:23:11,670 --> 00:23:16,220
I am always ready
as long as we fight the enemy.

215
00:23:39,100 --> 00:23:42,380
You are free now, Aktemur
Bey, as you deserve.

216
00:23:42,430 --> 00:23:45,430
Thank you, Boran.
Justice always takes its course.

217
00:23:45,840 --> 00:23:47,000
Yes.

218
00:23:53,350 --> 00:23:57,740
How is Orhan Bey doing?

219
00:23:57,960 --> 00:23:59,980
He is fine
and will get better, Inshallah.

220
00:24:00,610 --> 00:24:03,710
Inshallah, did you find someone
who committed this betrayal?

221
00:24:06,410 --> 00:24:09,300
We haven't found him yet, my daughter,
but we will.

222
00:24:09,420 --> 00:24:12,100
No one will escape punishment.

223
00:24:14,870 --> 00:24:19,970
If Orhan Bey does not recover, the chair
will belong to Aladdin Bey, right?

224
00:24:22,370 --> 00:24:27,400
It's not the time to talk about this, Bengi
Hatun. Orhan will recover, Inshallah.

225
00:24:27,740 --> 00:24:30,550
He will definitely get better, Inshallah.

226
00:24:34,200 --> 00:24:39,890
There's something going on in my mind
but, I'm afraid you'll get me wrong.

227
00:24:41,830 --> 00:24:44,280
If there is anything you know,
tell us, Bengi Hatun.

228
00:24:45,780 --> 00:24:49,860
Orha Bey is the heir to rule
in the Kayı tribe, right?

229
00:24:50,840 --> 00:24:53,850
I mean, he was like that before
he was bedridden.

230
00:25:02,860 --> 00:25:08,390
I hope Aladdin Bey
hasn't done something stupid.

231
00:25:10,680 --> 00:25:13,950
He is still young and reckless.

232
00:25:14,350 --> 00:25:16,710
It is possible that he
is tempted by something.

233
00:25:19,400 --> 00:25:22,720
How can you slander my son, Bengi Hatun?

234
00:25:23,230 --> 00:25:25,610
Realize what you're saying, Hatun.

235
00:25:26,390 --> 00:25:28,620
- Or are you...
- I didn't do anything.

236
00:25:31,060 --> 00:25:34,050
I didn't do anything, mother.

237
00:25:34,740 --> 00:25:38,520
- Son.
- I didn't do anything.

238
00:25:47,520 --> 00:25:50,780
Son.
Aladdin.

239
00:25:51,030 --> 00:25:52,140
My son.

240
00:25:53,050 --> 00:25:54,180
Aladdin.

241
00:25:55,380 --> 00:25:56,930
Aladdin.

242
00:25:58,570 --> 00:26:00,250
Mother Sultan.

243
00:26:04,900 --> 00:26:07,770
Nobody knows that Avcı is
alive, right, Celali?

244
00:26:07,790 --> 00:26:09,590
Yes, Mother Sultan.

245
00:26:09,830 --> 00:26:14,650
No one doubted.

246
00:26:15,030 --> 00:26:18,000
And we got out of town undercover.

247
00:26:21,100 --> 00:26:24,040
From now on, you're a dead man, Avcı.

248
00:26:24,450 --> 00:26:27,460
You will not appear on the
scene without my order.

249
00:26:27,860 --> 00:26:31,600
While it would have been easy
to kill me, why didn't you?

250
00:26:32,540 --> 00:26:37,450
I don't sacrifice my garbage for the sake
of Osman, how will I sacrifice one of my men?

251
00:26:41,760 --> 00:26:47,400
People thinking you are a dead man will
facilitate my future campaigns.

252
00:26:59,210 --> 00:27:02,310
You will go to Olof, and you will
hide in İnegöl.

253
00:27:05,690 --> 00:27:09,760
My success in getting the Beys
behind me tied Osman's hands.

254
00:27:11,690 --> 00:27:15,570
Now we will tie Olof's hands.

255
00:27:20,010 --> 00:27:22,460
When the time comes...

256
00:27:22,970 --> 00:27:27,730
We'll throw Olof into the
flames to clear our way.

257
00:27:28,460 --> 00:27:30,770
My Bey was right.

258
00:27:31,510 --> 00:27:33,810
Mother Sultan manipulates everyone.

259
00:27:38,810 --> 00:27:42,230
Let's tell Osman Bey immediately, brother,
come on.

260
00:28:02,590 --> 00:28:07,110
Frigg did this
and we'll catch her sooner or later.

261
00:28:08,590 --> 00:28:12,520
We have to get her
out of İnegöl first, Malhun.

262
00:28:16,080 --> 00:28:17,870
- Mother.
- Yes.

263
00:28:18,130 --> 00:28:19,860
Can't you do something?

264
00:28:22,670 --> 00:28:27,200
We couldn't crush Olof's head, let's
at least help them with Frigg problem.

265
00:28:27,750 --> 00:28:29,880
What am I going to do, my daughter?

266
00:28:30,340 --> 00:28:33,840
I haven't seen that snake
since the truth came out.

267
00:28:35,670 --> 00:28:38,440
Besides, how
can I get her out of the castle?

268
00:28:45,080 --> 00:28:46,730
İnegöl Castle.

269
00:28:51,490 --> 00:28:56,790
I've sent word to our brothers in the
north, we'll be more powerful now.

270
00:28:58,780 --> 00:29:01,060
With or without them, my love.

271
00:29:01,770 --> 00:29:05,530
I will soon have the lands I promised you.

272
00:29:10,720 --> 00:29:13,650
This will never be easy.

273
00:29:16,340 --> 00:29:22,770
As long as Jesus' chosen soldiers are with
me, no one can stand against us.

274
00:29:26,030 --> 00:29:34,140
There is no one braver
than Odin's warriors, Olof.

275
00:29:36,910 --> 00:29:41,710
I fear you will realize
this on the battlefield.

276
00:29:43,000 --> 00:29:46,890
There is no fear in the hearts of those
who fight for Jesus, Frigg.

277
00:29:48,210 --> 00:29:53,190
You will know this when you feel the
greatness of Christianity in your heart.

278
00:29:55,570 --> 00:29:59,020
- Olof.
- Frigg.

279
00:30:10,470 --> 00:30:13,090
Tell me what did you learn.

280
00:30:13,250 --> 00:30:16,470
Osman has gone
to the lands of Karasids, Olof.

281
00:30:17,660 --> 00:30:19,930
There is no trace of Turgut either.

282
00:30:20,070 --> 00:30:23,770
Osman's lands have never
been so unprotected.

283
00:30:24,130 --> 00:30:28,080
They are waiting for us to lead
them like an obedient lamb.

284
00:30:28,350 --> 00:30:30,540
Let's make war, Olof.

285
00:30:30,730 --> 00:30:32,270
What are we waiting for?

286
00:30:32,510 --> 00:30:36,330
Let's turn Osman's lands into a lake
of blood in his absence.

287
00:30:38,170 --> 00:30:42,410
If Osman doesn't attack us even though
İnegöl is under our control...

288
00:30:42,680 --> 00:30:45,550
He must be planning a campaign.

289
00:30:45,800 --> 00:30:47,660
So, what do we do?

290
00:30:48,370 --> 00:30:50,310
We will attack everywhere.

291
00:30:50,660 --> 00:30:57,080
We'll take everything that Osman has
without allowing him to make any campaign.

292
00:30:57,350 --> 00:30:59,290
Make preparations.

293
00:30:59,730 --> 00:31:02,570
We will go to take back
the lands that belong to us.

294
00:31:07,570 --> 00:31:09,200
Olof.

295
00:31:10,140 --> 00:31:11,980
Where are you going?

296
00:31:13,040 --> 00:31:17,370
To the church, I will pray to God.

297
00:31:50,070 --> 00:31:54,020
- Tell me, Alps.
- We followed Avcı, as you commanded, my Bey.

298
00:31:54,180 --> 00:31:57,290
He's not dead, Mother Sultan plans a game.

299
00:31:57,940 --> 00:32:00,000
What are you saying?

300
00:32:00,460 --> 00:32:02,650
What are you saying?

301
00:32:04,810 --> 00:32:08,330
İsmihan.

302
00:32:11,060 --> 00:32:14,070
I wanted to believe you
because times are hard.

303
00:32:14,170 --> 00:32:16,910
But no, no.

304
00:32:17,150 --> 00:32:21,450
People of sedition always
think of their interests.

305
00:32:21,670 --> 00:32:25,000
I will strangle you with your tricks.

306
00:32:25,210 --> 00:32:27,290
I will strangle you with your tricks.

307
00:32:27,510 --> 00:32:30,780
How did you understand, my Bey?

308
00:32:30,920 --> 00:32:33,570
I doubted her helping us.

309
00:32:33,760 --> 00:32:35,570
I was right in my suspicions.

310
00:32:35,760 --> 00:32:37,470
What shall we do now, my Bey?

311
00:32:37,660 --> 00:32:39,410
You will go with Turgut Bey.

312
00:32:39,600 --> 00:32:41,690
But you will catch him alive.

313
00:32:41,850 --> 00:32:43,800
Don't let him run away.

314
00:32:44,040 --> 00:32:47,880
- The truth will come out sooner or later.
- Your command, my Bey.

315
00:32:48,130 --> 00:32:49,370
Let's go.

316
00:33:01,920 --> 00:33:06,220
Collect all the weapons from the surrounding
villages and bring them to the castle.

317
00:33:09,630 --> 00:33:12,530
May the great Jesus protect you.

318
00:33:16,100 --> 00:33:17,500
Cerkutay.

319
00:33:17,940 --> 00:33:20,610
Those will do a very bad job.

320
00:33:21,290 --> 00:33:24,290
They will attack somewhere but...

321
00:33:24,560 --> 00:33:26,840
We'll know, Ülgen Hatun.

322
00:33:27,810 --> 00:33:29,570
Come.

323
00:33:33,840 --> 00:33:35,520
Come.

324
00:33:40,200 --> 00:33:43,010
Your present task
is difficult, Ülgen Hatun.

325
00:33:43,180 --> 00:33:46,160
What are you saying? You
won't leave me alone, will you?

326
00:33:46,190 --> 00:33:47,940
What? Are you scared?

327
00:33:48,720 --> 00:33:53,270
You were saying: "I don't want Cerkutay
and I'll work it out on my own."

328
00:33:53,910 --> 00:33:58,100
Yes, I said that so you
wouldn't be afraid.

329
00:33:58,220 --> 00:34:00,410
I'm Kara's daughter,
why should I be afraid?

330
00:34:00,730 --> 00:34:03,450
You would be afraid in the
country of strangers...

331
00:34:03,485 --> 00:34:06,615
when you're separated from me.

332
00:34:06,870 --> 00:34:08,440
You...

333
00:34:09,710 --> 00:34:12,010
are Kara's daughter.

334
00:34:12,230 --> 00:34:16,260
You have a soft heart.

335
00:34:16,590 --> 00:34:20,370
You are virtuous and brave...

336
00:34:21,540 --> 00:34:24,380
Ülgen Hatun.

337
00:34:31,520 --> 00:34:32,790
Now...

338
00:34:33,330 --> 00:34:38,199
Go to Olof's church and find out
where they are preparing to attack.

339
00:34:38,340 --> 00:34:40,880
Be careful.

340
00:34:41,120 --> 00:34:43,070
And you, what will you do?

341
00:34:43,290 --> 00:34:47,239
I'll go to the armory and smash it.

342
00:34:47,370 --> 00:34:50,350
Those dogs will
lose their passion.

343
00:34:50,620 --> 00:34:54,050
Alone? Do you want to die, Cerkutay?
I will come with you too.

344
00:34:54,219 --> 00:34:57,660
If we are worrying about our life, what
are we doing here, Ülgen Hatun?

345
00:34:57,730 --> 00:34:59,600
But you stay.

346
00:35:00,030 --> 00:35:02,060
Stay alive.

347
00:35:05,120 --> 00:35:07,280
Okay, then.

348
00:35:08,040 --> 00:35:12,260
You shall go in peace, and you
shall return in peace, Cerkutay.

349
00:35:12,580 --> 00:35:15,210
Cerkutay does not die.

350
00:35:15,340 --> 00:35:17,020
- Give me a promise.
- I promise.

351
00:35:19,350 --> 00:35:20,540
Good.

352
00:35:21,020 --> 00:35:24,410
I'm going make Olof talk.
There's no getting away from this

353
00:35:24,570 --> 00:35:26,680
I will make him tweet like a nightingale.

354
00:35:26,810 --> 00:35:30,250
Is it possible that you
wouldn't do that, Ülgen Hatun?

355
00:35:30,470 --> 00:35:32,330
- Cerkutay?
- Yes.

356
00:35:32,520 --> 00:35:35,040
Be careful, okay?

357
00:35:36,930 --> 00:35:41,750
I haven't learned how to draw a sword
well yet.

358
00:35:42,120 --> 00:35:45,240
You'll teach me that, don't forget.

359
00:35:45,640 --> 00:35:47,260
I will never forget.

360
00:35:47,810 --> 00:35:49,100
Let's go.

361
00:36:00,330 --> 00:36:02,490
May it be a cure for my son.

362
00:36:07,630 --> 00:36:09,770
Son.

363
00:36:09,930 --> 00:36:11,370
Aladdin.

364
00:36:12,530 --> 00:36:14,290
My brother?

365
00:36:24,910 --> 00:36:26,640
Aladdin.

366
00:36:39,290 --> 00:36:45,180
If my brother can't get out of that bed...

367
00:36:49,210 --> 00:36:55,840
If he dies because of my sword...

368
00:36:56,490 --> 00:36:58,440
Aladdin.

369
00:37:02,120 --> 00:37:05,310
Then my blood will be lawful for
you, my mother, Malhun.

370
00:37:14,130 --> 00:37:16,780
Kill me with this sword.

371
00:37:35,060 --> 00:37:38,370
I never ever hear that from you again!

372
00:37:38,560 --> 00:37:42,860
Nothing will happen
to you or your brother.

373
00:37:43,890 --> 00:37:46,670
I will never allow this.

374
00:37:56,480 --> 00:37:58,590
We will not allow it.

375
00:38:00,310 --> 00:38:05,420
We will make those, who made us live
through this, pay for this.

376
00:38:10,050 --> 00:38:13,840
May Allah help us.

377
00:38:17,990 --> 00:38:23,590
This place is good, light a fire, Torahan.

378
00:38:23,760 --> 00:38:24,980
Your command, my Bey.

379
00:38:25,140 --> 00:38:26,870
What shall we do now, my Bey?

380
00:38:27,120 --> 00:38:29,150
We'll spend the night here.

381
00:38:30,400 --> 00:38:32,360
We'll get to the council tomorrow.

382
00:38:32,720 --> 00:38:34,340
Let's see Avcı first.

383
00:38:34,610 --> 00:38:37,580
When Avcı comes, we'll understand what
Mother Sultan is up to.

384
00:38:37,720 --> 00:38:39,830
Then, rest is the war.

385
00:38:41,240 --> 00:38:45,000
Let's send word to the tribe, then let the
preparations begin.

386
00:38:45,510 --> 00:38:49,790
The coming of Naiman is not a secret,
Orhan will be at the head of the Alps.

387
00:38:50,060 --> 00:38:52,690
They must have made all the preparations.

388
00:38:55,140 --> 00:38:57,140
Take this.

389
00:38:58,740 --> 00:39:00,850
In the name of Allah.

390
00:39:02,130 --> 00:39:04,240
Let's see.

391
00:39:05,230 --> 00:39:06,750
My Bey.

392
00:39:07,300 --> 00:39:09,350
Thank you.

393
00:39:12,130 --> 00:39:14,130
They broke your branch, Osman.

394
00:39:14,830 --> 00:39:16,480
Where are you?

395
00:39:17,220 --> 00:39:19,200
Where are you?

396
00:39:23,760 --> 00:39:28,710
Bear a little, my son,
bear, my hero.

397
00:39:30,650 --> 00:39:33,410
My Allah.

398
00:39:36,870 --> 00:39:38,870
My Allah.

399
00:39:41,800 --> 00:39:43,320
My Allah.

400
00:39:44,230 --> 00:39:45,880
My Allah.

401
00:39:48,070 --> 00:39:50,440
I lost my mother at an early age.

402
00:39:51,260 --> 00:39:55,830
I buried my brothers and
my father with my own hands.

403
00:39:56,770 --> 00:40:02,340
My heart is tired of
all those pains, but...

404
00:40:03,130 --> 00:40:06,130
this is much more difficult, My Allah.

405
00:40:09,850 --> 00:40:11,230
I pretend to be patient.

406
00:40:13,410 --> 00:40:15,690
I pretend to be patient...

407
00:40:16,130 --> 00:40:18,700
but my strength is not enough, my Allah.

408
00:40:21,130 --> 00:40:24,180
I'm so desperate.

409
00:40:30,730 --> 00:40:32,510
My Allah.

410
00:40:34,740 --> 00:40:35,990
Please, my Allah.

411
00:40:37,530 --> 00:40:43,720
Test me with my life, but don't test
me with my son's life, my Allah.

412
00:40:45,060 --> 00:40:47,690
You are the haven of the desperate.

413
00:40:47,890 --> 00:40:50,590
You are generous and you are kind.

414
00:40:51,090 --> 00:40:53,330
We have no refuge but You.

415
00:40:54,560 --> 00:40:57,060
You are the cure for this disease.

416
00:40:58,330 --> 00:40:59,810
Please, my Allah.

417
00:40:59,990 --> 00:41:02,250
Please, grant him health.

418
00:41:02,650 --> 00:41:04,280
Heal him.

419
00:41:04,770 --> 00:41:07,160
I have no one but my sons.

420
00:41:07,270 --> 00:41:09,640
Please, save them for me, my Allah.

421
00:41:11,080 --> 00:41:14,060
Please, my Allah, save Orhan for me.

422
00:41:15,440 --> 00:41:16,890
Amin.

423
00:41:19,010 --> 00:41:21,010
Amin, my Allah.

424
00:41:22,380 --> 00:41:23,720
Osman.

425
00:41:28,540 --> 00:41:29,970
Where are you?

426
00:41:32,810 --> 00:41:34,280
Orhan.

427
00:41:36,380 --> 00:41:37,890
Orhan.

428
00:41:46,670 --> 00:41:47,640
My Bey.

429
00:41:49,350 --> 00:41:50,360
My Bey.

430
00:41:51,950 --> 00:41:53,160
Are you okay, my Bey?

431
00:42:01,120 --> 00:42:03,830
Near Yenişehir
Caravansary

432
00:42:07,440 --> 00:42:12,420
Whatever Osman wished for, he
did not succeed in it.

433
00:42:13,420 --> 00:42:16,380
First, he wanted to gather
the Beys behind him but...

434
00:42:16,400 --> 00:42:19,390
When he did not succeed, he
was forced to obey.

435
00:42:21,710 --> 00:42:24,960
Osman is loyal to us now, Bayındır.

436
00:42:27,530 --> 00:42:33,260
A game is always being hatched in his head.

437
00:42:34,220 --> 00:42:35,860
Let's see what appears before us.

438
00:42:37,530 --> 00:42:40,470
Whatever, Mother Sultan.

439
00:42:41,140 --> 00:42:46,790
Osman will always be
disappointed in front of you.

440
00:42:47,690 --> 00:42:52,560
Getting rid of the scourge of Osman
and Naiman as well.

441
00:42:53,610 --> 00:42:55,580
This is our first goal, Bayındır.

442
00:42:55,750 --> 00:42:58,110
We kill two birds with one stone.

443
00:42:59,660 --> 00:43:05,630
You will not hesitate to make
any sacrifice for that.

444
00:43:14,590 --> 00:43:18,760
As you wish, Mother Sultan.

445
00:43:19,240 --> 00:43:22,560
My neck is sacrificed
for your sake, if you wish.

446
00:43:23,760 --> 00:43:25,740
Keep your neck to yourself, Bayındır.

447
00:43:27,170 --> 00:43:29,630
Your sincerity is enough.

448
00:43:34,890 --> 00:43:36,630
Beys will come in the morning.

449
00:43:37,520 --> 00:43:40,220
Receive them in the best way.

450
00:43:41,490 --> 00:43:49,280
So that we can handle Naiman when
he attacks us.

451
00:43:57,250 --> 00:43:59,890
İnegöl Castle

452
00:44:05,070 --> 00:44:07,950
May the great Jesus
Christ accept your prayers...

453
00:44:08,070 --> 00:44:09,160
Commander Olof.

454
00:44:09,420 --> 00:44:12,220
Thank you, sister...

455
00:44:12,670 --> 00:44:13,990
Irene.

456
00:44:15,030 --> 00:44:16,350
Irene.

457
00:44:18,510 --> 00:44:21,150
Tell me.

458
00:44:22,020 --> 00:44:24,650
Did that woman become a Christian?

459
00:44:31,760 --> 00:44:34,330
First, repent.

460
00:44:34,630 --> 00:44:37,680
You must make a confession.

461
00:44:38,590 --> 00:44:41,920
If you do not confess, your
prayers will not be accepted.

462
00:44:43,280 --> 00:44:45,640
Don't Catholics confess?

463
00:44:45,660 --> 00:44:46,670
We are Orthodox..

464
00:44:46,670 --> 00:44:48,550
Of course, of course it is.

465
00:44:48,680 --> 00:44:52,600
I mean.. we...
what I wanted to say...

466
00:44:53,900 --> 00:44:57,390
If there is...--
Whatever! Everyone is human!

467
00:44:59,950 --> 00:45:02,780
You don't look like any nun I've known.

468
00:45:07,840 --> 00:45:09,640
But I loved your ease.

469
00:45:10,120 --> 00:45:14,000
Make a confession and the Great Jesus
will help you.

470
00:45:18,310 --> 00:45:20,420
My first sin...

471
00:45:21,850 --> 00:45:23,650
and my biggest sin...

472
00:45:23,980 --> 00:45:25,260
when I was a kid...

473
00:45:25,390 --> 00:45:27,530
Whatever, childhood is over!

474
00:45:27,780 --> 00:45:30,810
What about sooner...

475
00:45:31,020 --> 00:45:33,150
For example, yesterday...

476
00:45:34,790 --> 00:45:35,990
Yesterday?

477
00:45:38,260 --> 00:45:42,950
Perhaps, it'd be best for me to speak to
your brother, Reverend Simon.

478
00:45:43,780 --> 00:45:47,580
Possible, talk to Simon.
I...--

479
00:45:47,740 --> 00:45:51,530
will call Simon and come here.

480
00:46:01,600 --> 00:46:03,550
Why are you afraid, Ülgen?

481
00:46:04,070 --> 00:46:06,180
You almost messed it up.

482
00:46:09,230 --> 00:46:11,900
I'll tell you the names of
the villages you will attack.

483
00:46:11,940 --> 00:46:13,580
Now, hear me carefully.

484
00:46:16,630 --> 00:46:19,280
Yenişehir

485
00:46:34,530 --> 00:46:35,990
Welcome, my Bey.

486
00:46:36,070 --> 00:46:37,900
Welcome, Yakup Bey.

487
00:46:37,930 --> 00:46:39,420
- Welcome, Yakup Bey.
- You're welcomed!

488
00:46:39,880 --> 00:46:44,930
Welcome, my Bey.

489
00:46:46,500 --> 00:46:50,640
Welcome, my Bey.

490
00:46:50,820 --> 00:46:52,850
So, this is Yenişehir.

491
00:46:54,740 --> 00:46:58,650
You think you are our equal
in this little town, Osman Bey.

492
00:47:20,880 --> 00:47:22,260
Welcome, Karesi Bey.

493
00:47:22,310 --> 00:47:26,240
Welcome, my Bey.

494
00:47:27,120 --> 00:47:31,380
Welcome, my Bey, welcome.

495
00:47:33,520 --> 00:47:36,520
My Bey, you are welcomed.

496
00:47:36,570 --> 00:47:38,040
Welcome, my Bey.

497
00:47:38,100 --> 00:47:42,370
You underestimated Söğüt
and took Yenişehir.

498
00:47:42,680 --> 00:47:48,040
But, despite that, you could not
become like us, Osman Bey.

499
00:47:48,630 --> 00:47:50,870
Welcome, my Bey.

500
00:47:51,090 --> 00:47:53,220
Welcome, my Bey.

501
00:47:53,270 --> 00:47:57,690
Welcome, my Bey, here you go.

502
00:48:12,080 --> 00:48:18,910
Welcome, welcome, Candar Bey.

503
00:48:18,990 --> 00:48:23,320
Welcome, my Bey.

504
00:48:23,570 --> 00:48:24,680
Come, please.

505
00:48:24,730 --> 00:48:27,750
Welcome, my Bey.

506
00:48:28,080 --> 00:48:31,440
You pulled us to your side
and then backed away.

507
00:48:31,870 --> 00:48:35,050
So, the right thing is to be behind Mother Sultan.

508
00:48:35,440 --> 00:48:36,910
Welcome!

509
00:48:48,520 --> 00:48:50,290
I thought you were smart.

510
00:48:50,460 --> 00:48:52,720
What do you say, Yakup Bey?

511
00:48:55,420 --> 00:48:59,240
The great Candar.

512
00:49:01,200 --> 00:49:05,210
Does a person obey
someone who's younger than him?

513
00:49:10,850 --> 00:49:13,090
Will you stand behind Osman Bey?

514
00:49:15,780 --> 00:49:19,260
What about you, Karesi Bey?

515
00:49:19,610 --> 00:49:24,120
You, who are going to become
the ruler of the seas,

516
00:49:24,960 --> 00:49:27,220
what convinced you to stand behind...

517
00:49:27,240 --> 00:49:29,580
a shepherd?

518
00:49:29,740 --> 00:49:33,440
We certainly have reasonable reasons.

519
00:49:35,120 --> 00:49:37,280
I beg your pardon, Mother Sultan.

520
00:49:38,490 --> 00:49:39,820
Say it.

521
00:49:39,980 --> 00:49:43,500
What makes you stand behind Mother Sultan?

522
00:49:45,490 --> 00:49:47,500
Loyalty.

523
00:49:47,920 --> 00:49:49,680
Loyalty to my country.

524
00:49:50,270 --> 00:49:53,990
If we're going to fight, we are fighting
for the Seljuk state.

525
00:49:54,770 --> 00:49:57,140
If a council of war is to be held...

526
00:49:57,380 --> 00:49:59,360
Seljuk state holds it.

527
00:50:03,060 --> 00:50:06,270
Let's say Mother Sultan backed down.

528
00:50:08,680 --> 00:50:10,380
When I'm here...

529
00:50:11,460 --> 00:50:15,890
Does Osman Bey have the
right to become a leader?

530
00:50:19,720 --> 00:50:21,470
Osman Bey is not an enemy.

531
00:50:24,730 --> 00:50:25,970
But...

532
00:50:27,820 --> 00:50:29,490
Who has strength?

533
00:50:32,330 --> 00:50:34,040
Who has army?

534
00:50:37,500 --> 00:50:42,450
You made a mistake, so, shut
up politely.

535
00:50:49,770 --> 00:50:53,410
It is clear that the war promise
you made to Osman...

536
00:50:53,690 --> 00:50:56,680
made Yakup Bey very angry.

537
00:50:58,840 --> 00:51:00,300
Don't worry.

538
00:51:00,450 --> 00:51:05,400
I don't accuse you of treason, nor
do I get angry with you.

539
00:51:07,420 --> 00:51:09,130
Thank you all.

540
00:51:10,120 --> 00:51:12,390
You answered my invitation.

541
00:51:16,270 --> 00:51:17,580
Yakup Bey.

542
00:51:18,330 --> 00:51:23,140
In difficult times like this, anger is
only towards the enemy.

543
00:51:23,730 --> 00:51:25,800
Let it be as you said, Mother Sultan.

544
00:51:27,890 --> 00:51:34,450
In fact, I love Candar Bey and
Karesi Bey like my two little brothers.

545
00:51:35,660 --> 00:51:37,440
Yakup Bey.

546
00:51:38,290 --> 00:51:41,110
You should love your
little brother first.

547
00:51:42,200 --> 00:51:45,360
Perhaps this is what prompted us to
stand behind Osman Bey.

548
00:51:46,320 --> 00:51:48,750
You have to get rid of your arrogance.

549
00:51:51,510 --> 00:51:52,600
Beys.

550
00:51:54,000 --> 00:51:55,310
Calm down.

551
00:51:58,060 --> 00:52:00,360
We came here to talk about our campaign...

552
00:52:00,980 --> 00:52:02,890
not to argue.

553
00:52:25,920 --> 00:52:27,100
Here.

554
00:52:27,690 --> 00:52:29,870
It's the end of the road for you, Avcı.

555
00:52:30,660 --> 00:52:31,880
What are you going to do?

556
00:52:35,010 --> 00:52:36,690
Now, when I kill you...

557
00:52:36,830 --> 00:52:38,780
you will understand
whose end has come.

558
00:52:38,800 --> 00:52:40,240
Come on, Alps.

559
00:53:17,340 --> 00:53:19,900
Mother Sultan will hold
you accountable for this.

560
00:53:20,010 --> 00:53:23,270
You will not be able to escape from
her hands this time, Turgut.

561
00:53:24,890 --> 00:53:28,650
When I will get the truth
from that poisonous tongue of yours...

562
00:53:28,880 --> 00:53:31,460
Mother sultan will not
be able to do anything.

563
00:53:32,130 --> 00:53:33,850
Tell me everything.

564
00:53:34,330 --> 00:53:36,910
Why did Mother Sultan do such a thing?

565
00:53:37,440 --> 00:53:38,910
Why did she keep you alive?

566
00:53:38,990 --> 00:53:39,650
Speak!

567
00:53:39,720 --> 00:53:41,320
It's not my time yet.

568
00:53:49,180 --> 00:53:50,080
Speak!

569
00:53:54,780 --> 00:53:56,400
To gather Beys behind her!

570
00:53:56,930 --> 00:53:58,740
And what
about İnegöl?

571
00:53:59,070 --> 00:54:01,360
Why did you sell my İnegöl
to Olof?

572
00:54:02,540 --> 00:54:03,850
Speak!

573
00:54:04,090 --> 00:54:05,230
We didn't sell it!

574
00:54:05,650 --> 00:54:06,670
You are lying.

575
00:54:06,880 --> 00:54:10,800
Avcı, you are lying to me!

576
00:54:17,740 --> 00:54:19,170
We didn't sell it.

577
00:54:19,770 --> 00:54:21,440
Olof took it.

578
00:54:25,010 --> 00:54:26,320
And what about Yenişehir?

579
00:54:26,350 --> 00:54:28,600
Are you the ones who
made people there sick?

580
00:54:28,970 --> 00:54:30,820
Are you the ones who
poisoned innocent people?

581
00:54:30,930 --> 00:54:31,930
What's the reason?

582
00:54:32,010 --> 00:54:35,530
Leave me, if I tell you this, Mother
Sultan will kill me.

583
00:54:36,110 --> 00:54:37,260
Avcı.

584
00:54:42,490 --> 00:54:44,140
Did you think we'd let you live?

585
00:54:44,480 --> 00:54:45,470
Turgut Bey.

586
00:54:46,290 --> 00:54:47,530
He won't talk.

587
00:54:47,900 --> 00:54:51,160
Let the tongue cease,
and the sword speaks!

588
00:54:52,080 --> 00:54:56,640
No, no, he won't die like that, Aykut.

589
00:55:00,210 --> 00:55:01,610
Bring the horses.

590
00:55:03,340 --> 00:55:06,250
So that we could tie each of his organ
to a horse.

591
00:55:07,870 --> 00:55:09,290
He can go to Karesi.

592
00:55:09,600 --> 00:55:11,120
He can go to Candar.

593
00:55:11,660 --> 00:55:13,150
He can go to Germiyanids.

594
00:55:13,470 --> 00:55:17,650
May Avcı, the faithful servant of Mother
Sultan, go all around the world.

595
00:55:22,320 --> 00:55:23,230
Avcı.

596
00:55:26,860 --> 00:55:30,240
You are a hero who loves his country
so much that I...

597
00:55:30,770 --> 00:55:33,520
I will scatter your pieces
all around the country.

598
00:55:34,080 --> 00:55:36,240
So that people will learn from you.

599
00:55:36,850 --> 00:55:38,770
They should know you.

600
00:55:40,670 --> 00:55:42,080
Come on, where are the horses?

601
00:55:42,100 --> 00:55:43,930
Stop!

602
00:55:44,320 --> 00:55:46,170
We did it.

603
00:55:48,860 --> 00:55:51,450
Frigg did it
behest of Mother Sultan.

604
00:55:51,690 --> 00:55:53,470
No, not enough.

605
00:55:53,470 --> 00:55:56,000
You will tell us everything.

606
00:55:57,100 --> 00:56:00,170
Now tell me.
That matter in the Karesi tribe council...

607
00:56:01,290 --> 00:56:02,800
Why did it fall on you?

608
00:56:03,200 --> 00:56:07,350
Because the one who found the traitor
and guaranteed justice is Mother Sultan.

609
00:56:09,390 --> 00:56:11,250
She lined everyone up behind her...

610
00:56:12,250 --> 00:56:14,370
and ended the reputation of Osman Bey.

611
00:56:17,340 --> 00:56:18,920
Avcı.

612
00:56:19,210 --> 00:56:21,900
- That's enough!
- Stop, I'll say everything!

613
00:56:23,310 --> 00:56:24,530
No.

614
00:56:24,810 --> 00:56:26,700
You won't tell me anything now.

615
00:56:27,690 --> 00:56:31,390
If you will, you will
tell everything in front of the council.

616
00:56:34,670 --> 00:56:37,120
So that everyone knows the truth.

617
00:56:39,610 --> 00:56:40,990
You will rest then.

618
00:56:43,470 --> 00:56:44,380
Take this dog.

619
00:56:47,260 --> 00:56:48,730
Let's go.

620
00:56:52,750 --> 00:56:54,090
My Bey.

621
00:56:57,610 --> 00:56:59,180
I got news.

622
00:57:00,250 --> 00:57:01,180
Naiman will...

623
00:57:01,850 --> 00:57:05,930
seem to enter Candar Bey
and Karesi Bey's lands...

624
00:57:07,520 --> 00:57:09,600
and make us disperse our army.

625
00:57:10,750 --> 00:57:12,770
But his main goal is...

626
00:57:16,110 --> 00:57:17,850
to head for these lands.

627
00:57:18,530 --> 00:57:22,090
What if he actually
does what he says?

628
00:57:23,550 --> 00:57:25,980
I do not have a unit
in my home country.

629
00:57:26,930 --> 00:57:28,710
Because I am here with you.

630
00:57:28,850 --> 00:57:30,970
Calm down, Candar Bey.

631
00:57:31,470 --> 00:57:33,010
If we weren't sure...

632
00:57:33,550 --> 00:57:37,450
we'd have sent the five thousand horsemen
of Yakup Bey to your country.

633
00:57:39,100 --> 00:57:40,290
However, Naiman...

634
00:57:40,900 --> 00:57:42,020
will come here.

635
00:57:42,090 --> 00:57:44,090
Are we sure...

636
00:57:44,700 --> 00:57:47,970
we have the power to
end Naiman, Mother Sultan?

637
00:57:50,930 --> 00:57:54,030
The Germiyan cavalry
often defeated the Mongols.

638
00:57:57,390 --> 00:58:00,890
Don't you trust your Alps?

639
00:58:01,330 --> 00:58:04,000
We trust them, Yakup Bey,
we trust them.

640
00:58:04,880 --> 00:58:07,840
The possibility
made us feel bad.

641
00:58:09,660 --> 00:58:11,580
When Naiman reaches these lands...

642
00:58:12,320 --> 00:58:15,040
Yakup Bey and I will meet him.

643
00:58:15,680 --> 00:58:16,780
Candar Bey.

644
00:58:17,310 --> 00:58:18,250
Karesi Bey.

645
00:58:19,070 --> 00:58:23,170
You will weaken him
from the left and right fronts.

646
00:59:10,540 --> 00:59:12,190
Where is Osman Bey?

647
00:59:14,910 --> 00:59:16,220
Salam Alaikum.

648
00:59:16,810 --> 00:59:18,220
Alaikum Salam.

649
00:59:18,450 --> 00:59:19,930
Alaikum Salam.

650
00:59:20,130 --> 00:59:21,660
Here I come.

651
00:59:24,030 --> 00:59:27,050
I have come to tell you that
your campaigns (move) are wrong.

652
00:59:30,530 --> 00:59:31,980
And what is the correct one?

653
00:59:33,310 --> 00:59:35,710
Enlighten us with
your right thoughts...

654
00:59:36,000 --> 00:59:37,050
Osman Bey.

655
00:59:37,520 --> 00:59:41,070
I will enlighten you,
or we shall all be defeated together.

656
01:00:14,890 --> 01:00:16,210
My Bey!
Avcı!

657
01:00:24,890 --> 01:00:25,820
They are there.

658
01:00:27,900 --> 01:00:29,600
Let's chase them.

659
01:00:29,630 --> 01:00:32,110
Baysungur, Acar.
You two stay with Avcı.

660
01:00:33,520 --> 01:00:35,820
Kutan, Aykut,
you two cut out their way.

661
01:00:43,730 --> 01:00:46,160
Don't, Avcı, don't.

662
01:00:46,530 --> 01:00:47,950
Don't die.

663
01:01:47,450 --> 01:01:49,500
İsmihan never stops messing with us.

664
01:01:49,570 --> 01:01:51,150
She thought of all our moves.

665
01:01:51,280 --> 01:01:52,800
What shall we do now, my Bey?

666
01:01:53,090 --> 01:01:54,250
Now...

667
01:01:55,250 --> 01:01:57,170
Avcı has to live.

668
01:01:57,610 --> 01:01:58,640
Come on, valiants.

669
01:01:59,570 --> 01:02:00,640
Let's go.

670
01:02:03,760 --> 01:02:04,780
He has to live.

671
01:02:04,940 --> 01:02:06,560
Avcı must live.

672
01:02:10,370 --> 01:02:11,890
In the name of Allah.

673
01:02:14,400 --> 01:02:16,000
Tell me, how's he?

674
01:02:17,710 --> 01:02:19,830
My Bey, it doesn't look like
he's going to survive.

675
01:02:19,870 --> 01:02:20,850
He will die.

676
01:02:33,790 --> 01:02:35,330
His death is not a good thing.

677
01:02:35,470 --> 01:02:37,470
The truth will not appear
like that.

678
01:02:38,480 --> 01:02:40,080
Many innocent people will die.

679
01:02:41,870 --> 01:02:43,100
May Allah help us.

680
01:02:46,190 --> 01:02:48,050
Your words are very challenging.

681
01:02:48,940 --> 01:02:50,670
What's that you know...

682
01:02:51,710 --> 01:02:53,390
and we don't?

683
01:02:53,660 --> 01:02:55,760
You are heading towards the ambush.

684
01:02:58,030 --> 01:03:00,350
We are aware of this ambush.

685
01:03:00,560 --> 01:03:03,330
You just think you
are aware of the ambush.

686
01:03:04,780 --> 01:03:05,710
However...

687
01:03:06,320 --> 01:03:08,080
This is the ambush itself.

688
01:03:08,480 --> 01:03:10,400
Don't underestimate, Naiman.

689
01:03:11,290 --> 01:03:13,760
He misleads your intelligence.

690
01:03:16,080 --> 01:03:18,220
He has spies among you.

691
01:03:22,080 --> 01:03:23,790
He is dragging you into a trap.

692
01:03:25,020 --> 01:03:26,110
Speak...

693
01:03:26,650 --> 01:03:27,710
Osman Bey.

694
01:03:27,850 --> 01:03:28,960
Yakup Bey.

695
01:03:30,000 --> 01:03:32,290
Have you sent Alps to
the lands of Candar Bey?

696
01:03:32,420 --> 01:03:33,540
I haven't.

697
01:03:34,610 --> 01:03:36,950
Here I am with my 20,000 horsemen.

698
01:03:40,350 --> 01:03:44,060
You think that Naiman
will go towards you with his whole army.

699
01:03:44,370 --> 01:03:47,240
We don't think, Osman Bey,
but we know that.

700
01:03:47,450 --> 01:03:48,650
Candar Bey.

701
01:03:49,450 --> 01:03:51,610
I told you that he has spies among you.

702
01:03:53,550 --> 01:03:57,970
Knowing that you are
gathered here, he changed his plan.

703
01:04:06,700 --> 01:04:07,710
First...

704
01:04:09,890 --> 01:04:16,660
The Mongol soldiers started entering
your lands from the northern side.

705
01:04:18,370 --> 01:04:20,700
The other part of the soldiers...

706
01:04:26,170 --> 01:04:28,560
began to enter Karesi Bey's territory.

707
01:04:30,750 --> 01:04:33,130
If you want to defeat the enemy...

708
01:04:33,920 --> 01:04:36,450
you should think like him.

709
01:04:39,330 --> 01:04:41,930
He knows that Yakup Bey's entire
army is here.

710
01:04:45,000 --> 01:04:46,250
And what about you?

711
01:04:48,330 --> 01:04:51,740
There is no trick in your plans.

712
01:04:53,460 --> 01:04:58,440
Here is your army
standing here, straight as a wall.

713
01:05:02,040 --> 01:05:06,550
I see that you underestimate the enemy.

714
01:05:07,390 --> 01:05:12,360
Do you think you're smarter than
everyone here right now?

715
01:05:12,790 --> 01:05:16,990
No, I think Naiman's move
is better than yours.

716
01:05:18,680 --> 01:05:20,820
He will not come here
with his entire army.

717
01:05:20,860 --> 01:05:23,070
Enough, Osman Bey.

718
01:05:24,550 --> 01:05:26,130
There is no such thing as "we."

719
01:05:26,930 --> 01:05:29,170
You are not part of
this army anymore.

720
01:05:30,530 --> 01:05:32,950
And you have no right to speak either!

721
01:05:40,370 --> 01:05:45,090
What do you know about us
to talk about spies?

722
01:05:46,090 --> 01:05:49,460
No rotten fruit grows on our tree.

723
01:05:52,860 --> 01:05:55,050
Naiman is coming here with his whole army.

724
01:05:55,360 --> 01:05:58,150
We will wait for
him here together.

725
01:06:01,690 --> 01:06:06,540
Yakup Bey, you'll give five thousand
of your horsemen to Candar Bey.

726
01:06:08,630 --> 01:06:12,370
You'll give another five thousand
of your horsemen to Karesi Bey.

727
01:06:14,410 --> 01:06:19,350
Otherwise, they will destroy us.

728
01:06:22,310 --> 01:06:23,450
What if he's
telling the truth?

729
01:06:23,490 --> 01:06:25,850
Osman Bey is not telling the truth.

730
01:06:26,950 --> 01:06:30,850
He would like us to be
defeated and lose our reputation.

731
01:06:32,150 --> 01:06:36,740
He wants to do what the enemy wanted and
couldn't achieve. He wants our break up.

732
01:06:36,780 --> 01:06:39,430
There is no place for
his ideas in this council.

733
01:06:39,730 --> 01:06:42,190
If you don't do what I said...

734
01:06:43,070 --> 01:06:48,590
They will turn our country, which
looks like heaven, into hell.

735
01:06:49,740 --> 01:06:51,680
You are not part
of this army anymore.

736
01:06:54,730 --> 01:07:00,420
Your words won't apply to the army, which
you're not a part of, Osman Bey.

737
01:07:00,830 --> 01:07:03,780
You will burn these lands because of your stubbornness

738
01:07:05,460 --> 01:07:07,350
It's not about stubbornness, Osman Bey.

739
01:07:08,420 --> 01:07:10,850
We are sure about our plan.

740
01:07:11,870 --> 01:07:15,740
You will see, we will win.

741
01:07:15,740 --> 01:07:21,190
This move won't bring us victory.
It'll be our end.

742
01:07:29,500 --> 01:07:32,300
When the lands of
Candar and Karasi burn

743
01:07:32,710 --> 01:07:37,380
They will have surrounded us
from the north and the south

744
01:07:41,690 --> 01:07:44,460
They will have surrounded our armies

745
01:07:48,250 --> 01:07:49,830
Mother Sultan.

746
01:07:51,330 --> 01:07:57,210
If we do this, our defeat becomes certain.

747
01:07:59,140 --> 01:08:02,580
Osman Bey, it's enough.

748
01:08:02,930 --> 01:08:08,390
Go to your tribe if you don't want
to held in prison during the war.

749
01:08:09,110 --> 01:08:11,180
Don't bother us anymore.

750
01:08:18,830 --> 01:08:22,870
You are too arrogant to hear my words.

751
01:08:23,850 --> 01:08:29,250
Naiman will build a tower out of your heads.

752
01:08:33,410 --> 01:08:35,290
Remember what I just said.

753
01:08:40,990 --> 01:08:43,020
And this is my last word.

754
01:09:08,020 --> 01:09:08,960
Osman Bey.

755
01:09:09,670 --> 01:09:10,960
Is it bad news?

756
01:09:12,270 --> 01:09:13,899
My Bey, it's Orhan Bey.

757
01:09:15,229 --> 01:09:16,740
What happened to Orhan?

758
01:09:18,740 --> 01:09:20,580
Orhan Bey is poisoned, my Bey.

759
01:09:21,010 --> 01:09:22,500
What are you saying?

760
01:09:23,830 --> 01:09:25,109
Is he okay?

761
01:09:25,680 --> 01:09:26,899
He is fine.

762
01:09:27,290 --> 01:09:31,330
But he can't get out of bed,
he can't move any part of his body

763
01:09:33,529 --> 01:09:37,100
Orhan...
Orhan...

764
01:09:48,140 --> 01:09:49,510
Thank you.

765
01:09:51,140 --> 01:09:52,590
Alps!

766
01:10:14,710 --> 01:10:17,980
The work is not finished, it is not finished!

767
01:10:18,410 --> 01:10:20,170
There is a lot of work.

768
01:10:25,450 --> 01:10:28,470
- Is there anything else left?
- There are few left.

769
01:10:28,470 --> 01:10:31,130
Help me to finish it

770
01:10:39,660 --> 01:10:42,110
Ignobles!

771
01:10:44,980 --> 01:10:47,790
Let me introduce you to Cerkutay.

772
01:10:54,610 --> 01:10:57,380
- What is happening here?
- What is this rumble about?

773
01:11:09,310 --> 01:11:11,050
Who is there inside?

774
01:11:11,050 --> 01:11:13,980
I'm coming! Wait!

775
01:11:17,700 --> 01:11:20,270
Wait, wait a little more.

776
01:11:25,350 --> 01:11:29,950
Open the door, what's going on inside?

777
01:11:29,950 --> 01:11:32,570
Come on, open this door!

778
01:11:32,570 --> 01:11:35,030
I'll open, wait, wait, wait!

779
01:11:35,050 --> 01:11:37,570
I will open, I will open all the doors now.

780
01:11:38,470 --> 01:11:40,310
Coming, coming.

781
01:11:42,500 --> 01:11:44,290
Open the door, who are you?

782
01:11:44,290 --> 01:11:47,050
Open the door, who are you?
Answer!

783
01:11:47,050 --> 01:11:48,700
Hang on!

784
01:11:53,220 --> 01:11:56,260
Or don't, up to you.

785
01:12:02,300 --> 01:12:03,460
Traitor!

786
01:12:30,420 --> 01:12:35,350
Let the state be above your cradle

787
01:12:35,870 --> 01:12:42,250
For sugar and syrup

788
01:12:42,250 --> 01:12:47,180
Sleep baby, sleep

789
01:12:57,010 --> 01:13:00,180
My son, whom I raised with lullabies

790
01:13:04,530 --> 01:13:06,970
What a great exam is this?

791
01:13:08,970 --> 01:13:11,860
But you will also pass this exam.

792
01:13:13,250 --> 01:13:14,980
You are very strong.

793
01:13:18,550 --> 01:13:20,420
You will stand back on your feet.

794
01:13:38,820 --> 01:13:40,370
Osman.

795
01:13:46,690 --> 01:13:48,070
Orhan.

796
01:13:52,010 --> 01:13:53,230
Osman.

797
01:13:54,550 --> 01:13:55,520
Orhan.

798
01:14:00,530 --> 01:14:06,550
Osman, Osman
they poisoned our son.

799
01:14:09,700 --> 01:14:12,370
They broke my arms and wings

800
01:14:18,410 --> 01:14:19,570
Malhun.

801
01:14:20,970 --> 01:14:24,120
No, no, don't cry.

802
01:14:24,840 --> 01:14:28,740
Dear Malhun,
I can't stand the tears in your eyes

803
01:14:29,220 --> 01:14:33,380
Don't cry, don't cry

804
01:14:37,170 --> 01:14:42,050
No, our arms and wings must heal.

805
01:14:42,050 --> 01:14:45,140
Our son will recover.

806
01:14:46,450 --> 01:14:49,100
He must be fine, he must be fine.

807
01:14:49,100 --> 01:14:52,270
He will heal, right?
He will heal

808
01:14:53,270 --> 01:14:56,980
He will heal, he will heal

809
01:15:01,270 --> 01:15:03,850
He will heal, Malhun

810
01:15:04,690 --> 01:15:06,500
You will stand strong like this

811
01:15:07,100 --> 01:15:11,220
Thank Allah
he has a mother like you behind him

812
01:15:11,570 --> 01:15:13,500
You stand behind him like a mountain

813
01:15:14,530 --> 01:15:17,830
Malhun, you have to be strong.

814
01:15:17,890 --> 01:15:21,390
You have to be strong in order to
help him.

815
01:15:21,390 --> 01:15:23,730
He has his mother standing behind him
like a mountain

816
01:15:25,220 --> 01:15:29,620
Keep your heart at ease, keep it at ease.

817
01:15:33,950 --> 01:15:35,740
He will be fine.

818
01:15:38,100 --> 01:15:41,260
He'll be fine, he'll be fine.

819
01:15:41,260 --> 01:15:42,630
Can I, my Bey.

820
01:15:44,010 --> 01:15:46,260
Come in, Kumral Abdal.

821
01:15:50,630 --> 01:15:52,010
Come.

822
01:15:54,790 --> 01:16:00,420
Orhan, Orhan, son

823
01:16:02,020 --> 01:16:04,660
Kumral Abdal, how is his condition?

824
01:16:06,740 --> 01:16:08,430
I can't identify the poison, my Bey.

825
01:16:23,360 --> 01:16:25,700
It does not kill, but it keeps him powerless

826
01:16:26,970 --> 01:16:28,020
How?

827
01:16:31,770 --> 01:16:33,510
He cannot move any part of his body.

828
01:16:35,900 --> 01:16:39,830
How?
What kind of poison is this?

829
01:16:47,630 --> 01:16:49,150
We don't know, my Bey.

830
01:16:50,860 --> 01:16:55,730
It's a poison unlike anything I know

831
01:16:56,850 --> 01:16:59,160
It affects the body slowly.

832
01:17:14,850 --> 01:17:17,770
Marmaragic Castle

833
01:17:20,860 --> 01:17:22,130
Alcicek

834
01:17:22,970 --> 01:17:24,910
Get the other packs, come on

835
01:17:27,540 --> 01:17:28,870
You stop.

836
01:17:36,730 --> 01:17:37,930
Do not you dare

837
01:17:38,280 --> 01:17:42,510
Don't say a single word
about poison, Esma.

838
01:17:42,600 --> 01:17:45,230
If not today, they will understand
that I did it someday.

839
01:17:45,780 --> 01:17:47,350
What will we do then?

840
01:17:47,610 --> 01:17:49,890
They will not realise.

841
01:17:50,020 --> 01:17:52,740
You will shut up
and they will search for the traitor

842
01:17:53,910 --> 01:17:57,330
But both Aladdin Bey and Orhan Bey
saw me in the tent.

843
01:17:57,780 --> 01:17:59,240
If not today, then tomorrow!

844
01:17:59,320 --> 01:18:00,830
They see you in the tent every day!

845
01:18:00,830 --> 01:18:02,380
You go into that tent every day!

846
01:18:02,380 --> 01:18:03,890
They won't suspect you.

847
01:18:04,460 --> 01:18:07,140
But if, let's say, you made
a mistake and they realised you...

848
01:18:07,530 --> 01:18:09,800
Then you won't say my name.

849
01:18:10,110 --> 01:18:13,010
Reveal Ismihan or Avci, whomever
you want!

850
01:18:13,400 --> 01:18:14,830
Think of your sister.

851
01:18:15,180 --> 01:18:18,000
You have brought this
misfortune upon us, Bengi Hatun.

852
01:18:18,000 --> 01:18:20,120
What are you saying, Esma?

853
01:18:20,120 --> 01:18:21,080
Mother!

854
01:18:21,180 --> 01:18:22,870
How could you do this?

855
01:18:22,990 --> 01:18:25,000
You will gather everyone around us!

856
01:18:25,790 --> 01:18:27,050
Let them!

857
01:18:27,220 --> 01:18:30,340
What did you do?
Why did you commit this betrayal?

858
01:18:30,340 --> 01:18:31,420
Esma!

859
01:18:31,770 --> 01:18:33,800
Say something, Esma!

860
01:18:33,920 --> 01:18:34,990
I was forced!

861
01:18:35,140 --> 01:18:37,730
They forced me for my sister 's sake,
Alcicek Hatun!

862
01:18:37,730 --> 01:18:38,830
Esma!

863
01:18:48,750 --> 01:18:51,050
This is the hardest part of motherhood.

864
01:18:53,710 --> 01:18:55,840
My son is in pain

865
01:18:56,480 --> 01:18:58,820
As for me, my heart becomes hell.

866
01:19:03,610 --> 01:19:05,340
A wolf gives birth to wolves solely.

867
01:19:06,170 --> 01:19:08,160
As long as he has a mother like you...

868
01:19:09,000 --> 01:19:11,400
...don't worry, he
will get over this.

869
01:19:13,130 --> 01:19:14,670
He'll get over this.

870
01:19:15,430 --> 01:19:17,540
But those who broke my branch...

871
01:19:20,390 --> 01:19:23,080
...those who did this to my son...

872
01:19:23,910 --> 01:19:26,560
I will rip their hearts out with my own hands.

873
01:19:29,910 --> 01:19:31,560
We'll both do it!

874
01:19:37,440 --> 01:19:38,500
Orhan

875
01:19:38,680 --> 01:19:39,710
Father.

876
01:19:41,180 --> 01:19:42,300
Orhan.

877
01:20:08,960 --> 01:20:10,260
No no.

878
01:20:10,740 --> 01:20:12,810
No, Orhan
Orhan.

879
01:20:18,960 --> 01:20:20,160
Mother.

880
01:20:20,730 --> 01:20:21,760
Son.

881
01:20:22,040 --> 01:20:23,470
Straighten me up.

882
01:20:23,680 --> 01:20:25,070
Okay son

883
01:20:26,550 --> 01:20:27,710
Dear Orhan.

884
01:20:42,420 --> 01:20:43,740
Son.

885
01:20:52,240 --> 01:20:54,180
- Father.
- Yes.

886
01:20:54,730 --> 01:20:59,180
I don't want you
to see me crippled like that.

887
01:21:12,200 --> 01:21:13,170
Son!

888
01:21:14,230 --> 01:21:15,800
How can you speak like that!?

889
01:21:16,320 --> 01:21:17,940
Never again you shall speak of it.

890
01:21:22,460 --> 01:21:25,680
You will recover.

891
01:21:26,240 --> 01:21:28,040
You will recover if Allah permits.

892
01:21:29,670 --> 01:21:31,030
Kumral Abdal.

893
01:21:32,120 --> 01:21:34,060
He did everything he could
but still nothing, father.

894
01:21:36,370 --> 01:21:37,410
I...

895
01:21:39,610 --> 01:21:40,990
I became a burden to you.

896
01:21:44,110 --> 01:21:47,530
Can a son become a burden on his parents?

897
01:21:49,730 --> 01:21:52,040
I carried you in my womb for nine months.

898
01:21:52,430 --> 01:21:54,750
I will carry you on my back
for the rest of my life.

899
01:21:54,810 --> 01:21:57,070
I just want you to be fine, son.

900
01:21:57,500 --> 01:21:59,060
Just be fine.

901
01:22:03,440 --> 01:22:04,820
Not possible like this, mother.

902
01:22:06,360 --> 01:22:08,110
Is this how a son of
a Bey should be like?

903
01:22:10,520 --> 01:22:12,200
I can't even raise my arms.

904
01:22:16,670 --> 01:22:18,040
I am a burden to you.

905
01:22:22,560 --> 01:22:23,880
A burden to my father.

906
01:22:26,980 --> 01:22:28,280
Especially to my brother.

907
01:22:31,330 --> 01:22:33,610
I am in pain of remorse.

908
01:22:34,580 --> 01:22:36,690
Look at me.

909
01:22:38,050 --> 01:22:39,250
You are not a burden to me.

910
01:22:40,350 --> 01:22:41,630
Neither to you tribe.

911
01:22:43,060 --> 01:22:44,100
Son.

912
01:22:45,370 --> 01:22:47,220
You are my secret.

913
01:22:49,410 --> 01:22:51,200
You are my first child.

914
01:22:53,590 --> 01:22:54,600
Don't.

915
01:22:55,950 --> 01:22:57,110
Don't.

916
01:22:59,700 --> 01:23:01,510
You won't give up, son.

917
01:23:02,820 --> 01:23:05,220
The day you moved your finger...

918
01:23:08,010 --> 01:23:09,660
...I understood you were strong.

919
01:23:12,740 --> 01:23:15,640
You are strong, you will never give up.

920
01:23:15,920 --> 01:23:17,160
You will be fine.

921
01:23:19,920 --> 01:23:27,140
And you will hold them
accountable for doing this to you

922
01:23:29,490 --> 01:23:30,980
We will hold them accountable.

923
01:23:31,700 --> 01:23:33,770
We will hold them all accountable,
back to back.

924
01:23:34,200 --> 01:23:37,120
You will rise to your feet against the enemy

925
01:23:38,670 --> 01:23:40,090
Look at me.

926
01:23:42,060 --> 01:23:44,320
You will never give up.

927
01:23:46,310 --> 01:23:47,780
Promise me.

928
01:23:48,580 --> 01:23:51,940
You will get out of this bed
no matter what.

929
01:23:53,690 --> 01:23:54,870
I promise you, father.

930
01:23:55,960 --> 01:23:57,300
I promise I will get up.

931
01:24:14,670 --> 01:24:17,510
Inegol Castle

932
01:24:18,120 --> 01:24:20,660
Oh my!
Cerkutay!

933
01:24:22,550 --> 01:24:24,620
What if they do something to him?

934
01:24:25,270 --> 01:24:28,510
What if they caught him?
He would have already come otherwise...

935
01:24:28,510 --> 01:24:29,510
...Priest HÄ±risto!

936
01:24:29,510 --> 01:24:30,570
Do not worry.

937
01:24:30,740 --> 01:24:33,960
Cerkutay knows Inegol
better than Olof and his men

938
01:24:34,210 --> 01:24:35,300
And the castle too.

939
01:24:35,570 --> 01:24:37,440
He will come without being caught.

940
01:24:37,610 --> 01:24:39,820
Yes he knows, right?

941
01:24:39,990 --> 01:24:41,310
He knows everything.

942
01:24:41,910 --> 01:24:44,180
He is skilled in sword fighting.

943
01:24:46,360 --> 01:24:49,870
Oh Allah, may he return safely, and I will cook
for him burghur with meat!

944
01:24:50,330 --> 01:24:51,440
I heard you!

945
01:24:53,200 --> 01:24:54,910
I heard you!

946
01:24:54,910 --> 01:24:57,920
You said you'd cook bulghur with meat!

947
01:24:58,320 --> 01:25:00,410
You must keep your word, Ulgen Hatun.

948
01:25:00,600 --> 01:25:01,930
Cerkutay!

949
01:25:02,660 --> 01:25:04,710
You're here!

950
01:25:05,650 --> 01:25:08,120
But... what happened to you?

951
01:25:08,120 --> 01:25:09,290
Do not worry.

952
01:25:09,560 --> 01:25:12,080
It was a piece of cake for me.

953
01:25:12,210 --> 01:25:14,360
I blew up their weapons store.

954
01:25:14,360 --> 01:25:16,350
And also a couple...

955
01:25:17,030 --> 01:25:18,050
Seven...

956
01:25:19,970 --> 01:25:22,090
No more than seven...

957
01:25:22,900 --> 01:25:26,250
I killed many of their soldiers.

958
01:25:26,600 --> 01:25:27,900
Praise be!

959
01:25:29,710 --> 01:25:30,790
But...

960
01:25:31,240 --> 01:25:33,410
When I got out the main event started.

961
01:25:33,630 --> 01:25:37,070
Many soldiers started to surround me.

962
01:25:37,070 --> 01:25:38,920
If I did not know about
the secret tunnel...

963
01:25:38,920 --> 01:25:40,810
...I would be in real trouble.

964
01:25:40,810 --> 01:25:42,180
Allah forbid!

965
01:25:45,210 --> 01:25:47,500
I couldn't reach martyrdom again.

966
01:25:49,670 --> 01:25:50,930
But...

967
01:25:52,190 --> 01:25:54,530
I will teach you how to use a sword.

968
01:25:54,760 --> 01:25:58,170
It's not easy,
is it, Ulgen Hatun?

969
01:25:59,150 --> 01:26:02,680
Yes, you will teach me, if Allah permits.

970
01:26:03,030 --> 01:26:04,240
It's not easy!

971
01:26:04,770 --> 01:26:08,530
What did you do meanwhile?

972
01:26:09,050 --> 01:26:10,490
Is there any news?

973
01:26:11,180 --> 01:26:13,610
Why did Olof make all that preparation for?

974
01:26:15,300 --> 01:26:17,940
I couldn't learn anything
from that obnoxious Olof!

975
01:26:20,280 --> 01:26:22,030
But I heard from his soldiers.

976
01:26:22,440 --> 01:26:26,070
You know, they'll attack Muslim towns
near Inegol...

977
01:26:26,580 --> 01:26:28,260
I heard all of the names of the towns.

978
01:26:28,260 --> 01:26:29,020
I memorised.

979
01:26:29,020 --> 01:26:30,160
Great.

980
01:26:31,420 --> 01:26:33,240
We must inform our Bey.

981
01:26:33,470 --> 01:26:37,750
They have no weapon to fight though.

982
01:26:38,120 --> 01:26:40,290
However, we must still be careful.

983
01:26:40,420 --> 01:26:41,680
We will be after them.

984
01:26:51,990 --> 01:26:53,480
Someone comes...

985
01:26:53,650 --> 01:26:55,790
And blows up my weapon storage...

986
01:26:56,160 --> 01:26:58,290
And you don't know anything!

987
01:27:05,940 --> 01:27:07,340
Who did this?

988
01:27:07,590 --> 01:27:09,350
How did you not see him?!

989
01:27:15,940 --> 01:27:19,540
Is not my life and
my castle entrusted to you?

990
01:27:19,890 --> 01:27:22,160
You will find him/her, do you understand?

991
01:27:22,740 --> 01:27:26,070
You will investigate all the strangers you see!

992
01:27:26,070 --> 01:27:27,240
Olof!

993
01:27:29,050 --> 01:27:30,290
Do you understand?!

994
01:27:37,740 --> 01:27:40,280
I am sure Osman is involved in this!

995
01:27:44,170 --> 01:27:45,710
You will find him/her!

996
01:27:46,020 --> 01:27:48,170
If you don't find him/her...

997
01:27:48,800 --> 01:27:50,530
...I will kill you all!

998
01:28:02,760 --> 01:28:03,940
There is news, Olof.

999
01:28:06,370 --> 01:28:07,610
A caravan.

1000
01:28:09,470 --> 01:28:12,430
A Turkish caravan set out on its way
to the Byzantine state.

1001
01:28:12,770 --> 01:28:14,750
It is loaded with a lot of goods.

1002
01:28:15,790 --> 01:28:18,210
They will pass by the path
near Inegol in the morning.

1003
01:28:44,330 --> 01:28:45,720
My Cicek(flower)

1004
01:28:46,880 --> 01:28:48,850
- My beautiful daughter...
- Do not you dare!

1005
01:28:49,610 --> 01:28:52,270
Don't ever call me daughter
without telling me about it!

1006
01:28:52,270 --> 01:28:54,090
How could you do such evil?

1007
01:28:54,790 --> 01:28:56,200
You will tell me.

1008
01:28:56,820 --> 01:28:57,930
You will tell me.

1009
01:28:57,930 --> 01:28:59,280
Notice your limits!

1010
01:28:59,420 --> 01:29:00,560
No.

1011
01:29:01,120 --> 01:29:02,540
Not this time.

1012
01:29:03,860 --> 01:29:06,170
You don't get to hit me this time.

1013
01:29:06,560 --> 01:29:09,010
You are the guilty one now.

1014
01:29:15,510 --> 01:29:16,720
I did not do anything.

1015
01:29:17,200 --> 01:29:18,890
Rather, the snake, Ismihan did it.

1016
01:29:18,890 --> 01:29:20,350
She used my name!

1017
01:29:20,490 --> 01:29:21,840
Tell me from the beginning.

1018
01:29:22,450 --> 01:29:23,640
From the beginning.

1019
01:29:23,850 --> 01:29:25,440
Did you make Esma a spy?

1020
01:29:25,600 --> 01:29:26,630
Yes, I made her!

1021
01:29:27,020 --> 01:29:29,310
In order to get news from the palace.
That's it.

1022
01:29:29,310 --> 01:29:30,890
I had no other intention.

1023
01:29:30,890 --> 01:29:32,780
You threatened her with her sister!

1024
01:29:33,100 --> 01:29:38,700
Were you going to kill the child whom
you raised, too after beacuse she had no family?!

1025
01:29:41,990 --> 01:29:44,380
Have you always been this evil, Mother?

1026
01:29:47,480 --> 01:29:49,210
You speak big words, Alcicek.

1027
01:29:51,920 --> 01:29:54,720
I did not differentiate between
you and those two girls!

1028
01:29:55,810 --> 01:29:59,280
I frightened Esma to make her
do her job secretly and decently.

1029
01:29:59,280 --> 01:30:00,800
But things got complicated!

1030
01:30:00,800 --> 01:30:03,140
If Ismihan did it, why are we guilty?

1031
01:30:03,500 --> 01:30:06,700
Ismihan stained Esma's hand with blood.

1032
01:30:07,060 --> 01:30:08,820
Esma is from out tribe.

1033
01:30:08,820 --> 01:30:10,540
If they learn about Esma...

1034
01:30:10,750 --> 01:30:12,660
Before Ismihan, we'll be in trouble!

1035
01:30:13,230 --> 01:30:14,730
Not just me.

1036
01:30:14,980 --> 01:30:16,730
Your father and you will
be in trouble too.

1037
01:30:17,190 --> 01:30:24,190
Then you will not be able to marry Aktemur,
whom you have loved so much throughout your life

1038
01:30:24,760 --> 01:30:29,180
Then you're going to help them catch that snake
called Frigg, Mother!

1039
01:30:29,560 --> 01:30:32,970
You will find the antidote
and make Orhan recover!

1040
01:30:33,490 --> 01:30:35,230
Otherwise, aside from Aktemur...

1041
01:30:35,790 --> 01:30:40,370
I will sacrifice my life and
tell everything to Osman Bey myself!

1042
01:30:52,860 --> 01:30:55,270
Avci's death was not good at all, my Bey.

1043
01:30:56,520 --> 01:30:58,570
So we'll make another plan.

1044
01:31:00,400 --> 01:31:02,780
They pushed us out from the war.

1045
01:31:04,810 --> 01:31:06,800
They banished us from the army.

1046
01:31:14,250 --> 01:31:16,440
But we will take precautions.

1047
01:31:17,270 --> 01:31:19,130
We will form a defense line.

1048
01:31:19,840 --> 01:31:21,890
And no one will cross this line.

1049
01:31:22,850 --> 01:31:24,610
We will not allow them, of course!

1050
01:31:25,120 --> 01:31:26,550
Peace be upon you.

1051
01:31:27,750 --> 01:31:30,230
- Peace be upon you too
- Peace be upon you too

1052
01:31:33,290 --> 01:31:34,830
I hope the best for you.

1053
01:31:36,740 --> 01:31:38,130
Do not worry.

1054
01:31:38,940 --> 01:31:40,400
Orhan is strong.

1055
01:31:40,860 --> 01:31:43,280
We fought a lot back to back.

1056
01:31:43,780 --> 01:31:45,700
I know his strength is greater than his age.

1057
01:31:45,910 --> 01:31:48,190
Whatever the calamity that put
him into this situation...

1058
01:31:48,920 --> 01:31:52,700
With the strength of his family, he will
surely push this it away.

1059
01:31:53,370 --> 01:31:54,570
Of course.

1060
01:31:55,450 --> 01:31:57,880
He will be stronger than ever.

1061
01:31:58,310 --> 01:31:59,430
Inshallah.

1062
01:32:04,590 --> 01:32:05,970
But...

1063
01:32:07,570 --> 01:32:09,450
His exam is difficult right now.

1064
01:32:15,320 --> 01:32:17,640
Our exam doesn't seem very easy either.

1065
01:32:18,000 --> 01:32:20,090
We've never experienced
anything more difficult.

1066
01:32:23,390 --> 01:32:24,860
Right now...

1067
01:32:26,100 --> 01:32:29,570
They think that Naiman's army
will attack them in one body.

1068
01:32:31,050 --> 01:32:33,040
They don't realise that...

1069
01:32:34,350 --> 01:32:36,230
They will be attaced from
divided troops.

1070
01:32:36,850 --> 01:32:40,650
From north to Candar,
From south to Karasi.

1071
01:32:41,530 --> 01:32:44,870
Their spies think this is a trap.

1072
01:32:46,420 --> 01:32:49,660
We will not establish our defence
line in the east

1073
01:32:50,350 --> 01:32:55,250
We will defend the north and the south.

1074
01:32:56,270 --> 01:33:02,140
For this reason, Send news to Sahin Bey,
Demirhan Bey and Uraz Bey.

1075
01:33:02,570 --> 01:33:04,390
They'll give us a thousand cavalry.

1076
01:33:06,710 --> 01:33:09,130
They will wait in the North.

1077
01:33:09,630 --> 01:33:13,730
And they will destroy those
who come from there in this valley

1078
01:33:15,110 --> 01:33:18,250
But they should know that...

1079
01:33:18,420 --> 01:33:20,940
...no alp will die before
killing 10 Mongol soldiers!

1080
01:33:24,890 --> 01:33:27,380
I'm blocking the path of the ignobles
coming from the south.

1081
01:33:29,180 --> 01:33:30,970
You will not come with us.

1082
01:33:32,050 --> 01:33:33,230
Why?

1083
01:33:33,860 --> 01:33:35,990
We always talk about the enemy in the east.

1084
01:33:37,470 --> 01:33:39,430
What about those in the West?

1085
01:33:43,370 --> 01:33:45,130
You will attack Olof.

1086
01:33:45,510 --> 01:33:49,200
I gave up my castle, Ingol Castle,
for the war against the Naiman.

1087
01:33:49,520 --> 01:33:51,500
Why would Olof be a problem for me?

1088
01:33:51,830 --> 01:33:53,380
He is a problem of course.

1089
01:33:54,900 --> 01:33:57,290
He's waiting for us to stumble.

1090
01:33:59,570 --> 01:34:06,000
At that time, he'll want to
conquer these castles.

1091
01:34:07,850 --> 01:34:12,800
He will want to attack the tribes
when he hears of the departure of the Beys.

1092
01:34:15,840 --> 01:34:20,210
If we do not protect our back,
we can't establish a line of defense here

1093
01:34:21,410 --> 01:34:22,350
As you say...

1094
01:34:22,630 --> 01:34:26,090
I will pounce on his head the
moment he takes his head out of that castle.

1095
01:34:29,000 --> 01:34:31,370
We will watch our back too.

1096
01:34:32,010 --> 01:34:33,080
Malhun Hatun.

1097
01:34:34,270 --> 01:34:35,080
Bala Hatun.

1098
01:34:37,450 --> 01:34:40,080
You two will organize The Sisters

1099
01:34:43,640 --> 01:34:48,180
You two will find who did this to my Orhan!

1100
01:34:49,640 --> 01:34:51,410
If we can't find...

1101
01:34:52,580 --> 01:34:53,880
...who did this...

1102
01:34:55,010 --> 01:34:57,180
...breathing is forbidden to us.

1103
01:35:03,240 --> 01:35:07,380
The enemy is also walking towards us,
let them come.

1104
01:35:10,500 --> 01:35:12,500
It won't be over until
we announce it's over.

1105
01:35:20,020 --> 01:35:22,090
What if Osman Bey is right?

1106
01:35:23,100 --> 01:35:28,630
I have never witnessed that
although I have been here for a while.

1107
01:35:29,470 --> 01:35:31,850
Osman wants to be the sole ruler.

1108
01:35:32,210 --> 01:35:35,340
We will lose if we believe him.

1109
01:35:37,020 --> 01:35:40,350
What will Osman gain if we lose?

1110
01:35:40,350 --> 01:35:42,350
He will gain dominance.

1111
01:35:43,820 --> 01:35:48,270
Osman wanted to be at the
head of the army, but he did not succeed.

1112
01:35:48,590 --> 01:35:52,970
He wants to drive us to defeat now.

1113
01:35:55,860 --> 01:35:59,590
Othman will be stronger
if we lose our strength.

1114
01:36:00,530 --> 01:36:03,990
Candar Bey and Karasi Bey
showed interest in him.

1115
01:36:07,940 --> 01:36:10,390
His influence on nomads is also great.

1116
01:36:11,620 --> 01:36:16,930
That's why we don't have a
chance to make a mistake.

1117
01:36:18,270 --> 01:36:20,140
We will win this war.

1118
01:36:20,140 --> 01:36:23,290
We will level Osman's reputation
to the ground.

1119
01:36:24,270 --> 01:36:30,330
So that the nomads will go
to your lands and not to his lands.

1120
01:36:30,330 --> 01:36:34,190
Let us get rid of this trouble first.

1121
01:36:35,630 --> 01:36:42,110
What if Osman tries to make a move
and makes the situation even more difficult?

1122
01:36:42,110 --> 01:36:44,340
I can't stand
Osman anymore, Yakup Bey.

1123
01:36:46,690 --> 01:36:50,010
I will jail him if he confronts me again.

1124
01:36:51,770 --> 01:36:57,150
Mother Sultan, is it a good idea
to go that far in this troubled times?

1125
01:36:58,570 --> 01:37:01,340
Everyone goes far in relieved times.

1126
01:37:01,340 --> 01:37:05,180
You are with me because I go far
in difficult times, Yaup Bey.

1127
01:37:06,110 --> 01:37:10,450
We will destroy Naiman and
weaken Osman's power

1128
01:37:10,450 --> 01:37:13,650
We will come out of this
difficult time stronger.

1129
01:37:26,130 --> 01:37:27,910
O my Creator.

1130
01:37:35,530 --> 01:37:37,010
O my Creator.

1131
01:37:39,630 --> 01:37:41,660
What kind of pain is this?

1132
01:37:44,770 --> 01:37:47,500
What kind of fire is this, my Creator?

1133
01:37:52,700 --> 01:37:54,490
My son's pain...

1134
01:38:00,900 --> 01:38:02,980
It cauterizes my heart

1135
01:38:04,350 --> 01:38:06,130
O Creator.

1136
01:38:07,640 --> 01:38:09,230
But his grief...

1137
01:38:11,750 --> 01:38:13,960
His grief is not for himself.

1138
01:38:15,110 --> 01:38:16,880
He says:
"I was going to be a Bey...

1139
01:38:18,975 --> 01:38:20,645
...but I ended up being a burden."

1140
01:38:27,090 --> 01:38:28,570
He says he has become a burden.

1141
01:38:30,770 --> 01:38:38,060
O Creator, O Creator,
he feels bad for us.

1142
01:38:39,020 --> 01:38:46,730
Oh my Allah, you
are generous, my Creator!

1143
01:38:48,430 --> 01:38:53,540
Grant us the strength of
patience in this exam.

1144
01:38:54,340 --> 01:38:59,510
You are the healer,
the cure comes from you, my Creator!

1145
01:39:01,630 --> 01:39:05,030
You heal whomever you want.

1146
01:39:05,030 --> 01:39:16,620
Oh my Allah, grant healing to all
those who seek healing, to my son, to Orhan.

1147
01:39:16,990 --> 01:39:19,460
Heal him, my Creator.

1148
01:39:22,830 --> 01:39:28,020
The disease comes from you just like
the cure comes from you, my Creator.

1149
01:39:29,060 --> 01:39:34,340
Heal him, my Creator.

1150
01:39:36,340 --> 01:39:39,310
Grant us with your mercy.

1151
01:39:40,490 --> 01:39:44,420
Amen.
Amen.

1152
01:40:10,370 --> 01:40:13,540
My sheikh, my sheikh.

1153
01:40:15,430 --> 01:40:17,860
I feel ashamed to be healthy.

1154
01:40:23,020 --> 01:40:31,220
Being able to move my arms and legs in
front of my son hurts me.

1155
01:40:32,630 --> 01:40:38,460
It hurts me, it hurts me my sheih.

1156
01:40:39,330 --> 01:40:41,690
When I see my son like that...

1157
01:40:46,300 --> 01:40:49,350
"I would like to follow the path of Hadrat Abraham"

1158
01:40:52,100 --> 01:40:57,750
"I would like to break the idols"
.Didn't you say these, Osman Bey?

1159
01:40:59,470 --> 01:41:06,330
Did you not know that you would be tested
with such tests in this path that you were asking for?

1160
01:41:07,730 --> 01:41:09,130
No.

1161
01:41:11,890 --> 01:41:14,150
Not breaking idols.

1162
01:41:17,150 --> 01:41:20,270
The knife that is on my son's neck...

1163
01:41:25,790 --> 01:41:27,050
I witnessed that.

1164
01:41:30,980 --> 01:41:33,580
I now understand it's
extreemly difficult to be Abraham.

1165
01:41:34,550 --> 01:41:36,330
I understand now.

1166
01:41:39,300 --> 01:41:41,270
I didn't know, my sheikh.

1167
01:41:41,650 --> 01:41:46,170
Seeing my son
so helpless, so sad...

1168
01:41:49,260 --> 01:41:52,740
He says he has become a burden,
he says he has become a shame

1169
01:41:53,700 --> 01:41:58,700
But not for himself.
Because he cannot serve the cauase.

1170
01:41:58,950 --> 01:42:03,220
This, my sheikh, is difficult to bear.

1171
01:42:03,220 --> 01:42:06,500
This weighs on me, this weighs on me.

1172
01:42:06,500 --> 01:42:13,790
Osman Bey, had it not been for these
difficulties and these exams

1173
01:42:14,900 --> 01:42:18,550
...how would we get closer to our Cretor?

1174
01:42:19,990 --> 01:42:29,740
Think, he gives his hardest
exams to the people he loves the most.

1175
01:42:32,010 --> 01:42:33,490
To his messengers.

1176
01:42:35,270 --> 01:42:40,230
We shall know that all this is happening
for a cause...

1177
01:42:40,470 --> 01:42:46,370
And that way we complete
the exam successfully.

1178
01:42:49,180 --> 01:42:57,510
We will put our hands over our hearts
in all circumstances and say, Alhamdulillah

1179
01:43:00,270 --> 01:43:06,250
Alhmdulillah. (Than Allah)
Alhmdulillah. (Than Allah)

1180
01:43:07,020 --> 01:43:13,740
We need to realise that our Creator
is the true owner of his blessings...

1181
01:43:13,740 --> 01:43:15,540
...including children.

1182
01:43:15,810 --> 01:43:17,850
We need to, yes.

1183
01:43:19,940 --> 01:43:28,580
You feel pain now because of the love
and compassion you feel for your children

1184
01:43:29,650 --> 01:43:31,260
But know that.

1185
01:43:32,190 --> 01:43:36,150
The mercy and love we have...

1186
01:43:36,150 --> 01:43:43,210
...is not even one percent of
Allah's love and mercy towards us.

1187
01:43:44,820 --> 01:43:51,610
If He has given us this
test, we have to be patient and trust

1188
01:43:53,130 --> 01:43:54,710
And we pray.

1189
01:43:57,180 --> 01:44:03,230
My Creator, who made your words
heal my heart shall also heal my son.

1190
01:44:03,230 --> 01:44:04,670
Inshallah.

1191
01:44:05,710 --> 01:44:07,380
Inshallah, my sheikh.

1192
01:44:09,760 --> 01:44:11,240
Inegol Castle.

1193
01:44:12,490 --> 01:44:15,830
You, the carriers of the wrath of north.

1194
01:44:15,830 --> 01:44:20,020
You will pour out your anger on that caravan.

1195
01:44:20,860 --> 01:44:25,300
No one will come out alive from
the caravan that we will target

1196
01:44:26,330 --> 01:44:31,180
The traitors who entered among us
have erased our weapons.

1197
01:44:32,020 --> 01:44:38,770
But our axes, our shields, and the fire
of our vengeance are with us!

1198
01:44:38,770 --> 01:44:46,620
- Long live Olof!
- Long live Olof, long live Olof!

1199
01:44:48,470 --> 01:44:54,670
With an axe, sword, chest, or bare hand!

1200
01:44:56,330 --> 01:45:01,170
We will shed blood today,
we will shed Turkish blood!

1201
01:45:01,770 --> 01:45:03,670
Jesus Christ is with us!

1202
01:45:03,670 --> 01:45:19,780
Jesus Christ is with us!
Jesus Christ is with us!

1203
01:45:21,510 --> 01:45:23,540
Cerkutay and Ulgen are in Inegol.

1204
01:45:23,540 --> 01:45:26,590
We can get Frigg
out of the castle with their help.

1205
01:45:26,590 --> 01:45:30,340
This is our last chance.
Let's send an informant quickly.

1206
01:45:30,340 --> 01:45:31,900
Can I?

1207
01:45:34,590 --> 01:45:36,340
Come, Bengi Hatun!

1208
01:45:44,780 --> 01:45:46,710
I will help you.

1209
01:45:53,060 --> 01:45:54,450
I sent a message to Frig

1210
01:45:55,210 --> 01:46:00,170
I told her that Mother Sultan had business with her,
and invited her to Marmaraci.

1211
01:46:02,820 --> 01:46:05,630
What's it, Bengi Hatun?

1212
01:46:06,860 --> 01:46:10,380
Why are you doing this favour to us?

1213
01:46:10,750 --> 01:46:13,710
We're related now, Malhun Hatun.

1214
01:46:13,890 --> 01:46:16,590
Apart from that, it's a matter of life
of a child.

1215
01:46:18,980 --> 01:46:21,950
When will I help
if I don't help on a day like this?!

1216
01:46:21,950 --> 01:46:27,290
So, we'll set an ambush
on the road and catch her.

1217
01:46:32,630 --> 01:46:34,420
Sent by Bengi Hatun.

1218
01:46:36,420 --> 01:46:38,310
Send my greetings.

1219
01:46:43,010 --> 01:46:45,300
What are you asking for again, Bengi?

1220
01:46:51,620 --> 01:46:55,330
Get my horse ready!
We're going to Marmaragic

1221
01:47:08,550 --> 01:47:12,710
We'll have a lot of
losses when it's all over.

1222
01:47:13,780 --> 01:47:17,020
But I will have won anyway.

1223
01:47:17,590 --> 01:47:22,790
I will be a hero who
even risked her life for her people.

1224
01:47:23,170 --> 01:47:29,100
The Sultan, the mother of the Attic Seljuk state,
and the guardian and protector of all Turkmens.

1225
01:47:29,100 --> 01:47:32,340
May Allah keep you on our head

1226
01:47:34,340 --> 01:47:36,260
Thank you, Bayindir.

1227
01:47:37,780 --> 01:47:42,790
You too will double your wealth
when this war is over.

1228
01:47:43,750 --> 01:47:46,750
Thanks to you, Hadrat Mother Sultan.

1229
01:47:49,510 --> 01:47:56,050
And you too, Oktem Bey,
will be rewarded for choosing the right side.

1230
01:47:56,530 --> 01:47:59,380
Thank you, Mother Sultan.

1231
01:48:02,860 --> 01:48:06,510
The army must be organized first.

1232
01:48:06,510 --> 01:48:10,500
You will also make
the necessary expenses for this, Bayindir.

1233
01:48:14,510 --> 01:48:20,820
Bayindir's wealth is t your service,
Hadrat Mother Sultan.

1234
01:48:20,820 --> 01:48:22,150
Don't worry.

1235
01:48:22,790 --> 01:48:26,330
All the Beys will contribute.

1236
01:48:28,140 --> 01:48:31,350
This is a huge war, Bayindir.

1237
01:48:32,180 --> 01:48:34,930
So big that you can't even imagine.

1238
01:48:34,930 --> 01:48:39,210
Are you saying that three
large emirates and dozens of armies...

1239
01:48:39,210 --> 01:48:42,780
...won't be enough, Mother Sultan?

1240
01:48:43,530 --> 01:48:46,250
Let's see the armies first.

1241
01:48:49,740 --> 01:48:54,540
Oktem Bey, you seem worried.

1242
01:48:54,670 --> 01:48:59,610
It's about Bey's.
No one is coming, Mother Sultan.

1243
01:49:04,870 --> 01:49:09,650
Mother Sultan, Karasi Bey and his
army is approaching.

1244
01:49:11,230 --> 01:49:15,860
They can't disobey me
like they disobey Osman Bey.

1245
01:49:17,180 --> 01:49:19,330
Of course, Mother Sultan.

1246
01:49:19,740 --> 01:49:22,420
Of course they will come, Oktem Bey.

1247
01:50:32,580 --> 01:50:33,390
Father.

1248
01:50:35,580 --> 01:50:37,030
I will tell you something

1249
01:50:38,060 --> 01:50:39,950
But don't get angry

1250
01:50:44,110 --> 01:50:44,940
Son.

1251
01:50:47,180 --> 01:50:49,000
I'll be angry if I need to be.

1252
01:51:10,150 --> 01:51:13,880
Allah knows what I feel.
I'll let you know too, father.

1253
01:51:19,040 --> 01:51:23,580
I think about this all the
time, after what I did to my brother.

1254
01:51:25,310 --> 01:51:30,840
I... I
know you've waited so long for me.

1255
01:51:32,550 --> 01:51:35,750
- And you said that my birth was a miracle
- Yes.

1256
01:51:37,920 --> 01:51:40,980
I am not a miracle, father,
but I am a test for you

1257
01:51:46,590 --> 01:51:48,550
I caused my brother
to be in this situation

1258
01:51:52,440 --> 01:51:53,650
Maybe if I wasn't...

1259
01:51:54,950 --> 01:51:58,000
Son, how can you speak like that?

1260
01:51:59,290 --> 01:52:00,690
Tell me, does it suit you?

1261
01:52:01,850 --> 01:52:04,950
It was not appropriate for me to make my brother
fall in this position either, father.

1262
01:52:05,550 --> 01:52:07,670
But I caused it.

1263
01:52:09,640 --> 01:52:12,510
Raise your head
raise your head, Aladdin.

1264
01:52:13,850 --> 01:52:15,980
You are not the one who caused this.

1265
01:52:16,660 --> 01:52:20,860
Whoever did this wanted
to use you.

1266
01:52:22,390 --> 01:52:26,970
The ones who wanted to hurt him
could hurt him in other ways too.

1267
01:52:29,040 --> 01:52:31,810
Their intention was to use you.

1268
01:52:32,190 --> 01:52:35,830
Their goal is to create a
enmity between you brothers

1269
01:52:36,000 --> 01:52:36,930
Be careful.

1270
01:52:37,460 --> 01:52:39,800
Beware!
Don't fall into their plan.

1271
01:52:40,640 --> 01:52:45,130
Your brother will rise to his feet
just like how he fell.

1272
01:52:45,500 --> 01:52:47,450
And you, too, should not despair.

1273
01:52:48,980 --> 01:52:50,750
We will get through this together.

1274
01:52:51,390 --> 01:52:53,480
We'll rise together, son.

1275
01:52:58,890 --> 01:53:00,420
Come on son.

1276
01:53:01,720 --> 01:53:03,130
Come on let's see.

1277
01:53:03,270 --> 01:53:05,710
Come on let's see.

1278
01:53:11,320 --> 01:53:12,790
Bring that.

1279
01:53:16,820 --> 01:53:18,180
Give it to me.

1280
01:53:21,100 --> 01:53:22,010
Hold it.

1281
01:53:22,270 --> 01:53:27,440
We will always work; So
we can stand on our feet.

1282
01:53:30,820 --> 01:53:34,090
We must not stop
We must not stop

1283
01:53:45,200 --> 01:53:46,420
Let's go.

1284
01:53:47,380 --> 01:53:48,490
Let's go

1285
01:53:50,740 --> 01:53:53,510
O Allah! O Allah!

1286
01:53:53,620 --> 01:53:57,270
O Allah! O Allah!
O Allah! O Allah!

1287
01:54:13,410 --> 01:54:15,440
Brother, investigate what happened there.

1288
01:54:51,160 --> 01:54:52,500
Kill everyone.

1289
01:54:56,480 --> 01:54:58,610
Leave no one alive

1290
01:56:14,360 --> 01:56:15,990
Raise your shields

1291
01:56:35,290 --> 01:56:36,770
Olof

1292
01:56:38,590 --> 01:56:41,430
You shouldn't have gone outside those walls!

1293
01:56:47,000 --> 01:56:50,500
How fortunate I am
because I will take your soul now

1294
01:56:51,820 --> 01:56:57,300
The only thing I will give you
is my bloody sword, Turgut!

1295
01:56:58,220 --> 01:56:59,740
Come and take it!

1296
01:57:06,190 --> 01:57:08,120
At my command, alps.

1297
01:57:10,560 --> 01:57:12,530
Attack!

1298
01:57:13,560 --> 01:57:15,290
Attack!

1299
01:57:36,740 --> 01:57:38,830
They are coming, Bala Hatun.

1300
01:57:43,170 --> 01:57:46,430
Come on, sisters,
our fight shall be blessed.

1301
01:57:48,480 --> 01:57:49,570
Let's go.

1302
01:57:57,680 --> 01:58:01,000
Come and see
you two-faced demon!

1303
01:58:17,320 --> 01:58:20,840
Come on sisters
O Right!

1304
01:58:21,140 --> 01:58:22,800
Oh Right!

1305
01:58:24,000 --> 01:58:26,910
Oh Right!

1306
01:58:37,270 --> 01:58:42,060
Allah is the greatest!
Allah is the greatest!

1307
01:58:42,260 --> 01:58:44,210
Allah is the greatest!

1308
01:59:27,080 --> 01:59:28,820
I'm here Bala.

1309
01:59:32,040 --> 01:59:34,590
- I'm here.
- You Snake.

1310
01:59:53,980 --> 01:59:56,860
The Kayi Sisters will
ambush you on the way.

1311
01:59:56,940 --> 02:00:00,280
They asked me to summon you to
Marmaragic Castle, so be careful.

1312
02:00:03,260 --> 02:00:05,270
Today is the day of reckoning, Frigg.

1313
02:00:06,170 --> 02:00:08,580
You will pay for what you did.

1314
02:00:10,520 --> 02:00:14,440
Bala,
look around you.

1315
02:00:19,220 --> 02:00:21,290
Game is over.

1316
02:00:22,700 --> 02:00:25,850
Osman will not save you now.

1317
02:00:26,530 --> 02:00:29,070
And who will save you from my hands?

1318
02:00:29,320 --> 02:00:31,200
You will die today, Bala.

1319
02:00:32,740 --> 02:00:36,270
The end of these paths
leads to us, Frigg.

1320
02:00:40,440 --> 02:00:44,230
- Now!
- Oh Right!

1321
02:00:59,670 --> 02:01:04,300
Now is the time for you to pay for the
innocent blood you have shed, Olof!

1322
02:01:04,470 --> 02:01:09,050
I will not die without cutting off your heads
on these lands, Turgut!

1323
02:01:41,500 --> 02:01:44,400
Your soldiers are falling one by one.

1324
02:01:44,660 --> 02:01:47,640
Now I will rip your head off with my sword.

1325
02:01:47,900 --> 02:01:51,180
Yes, come, Turgut.

1326
02:02:22,410 --> 02:02:26,070
It's time for you to die by my sword.

1327
02:02:26,330 --> 02:02:28,410
Do you think I didn't get prepared?

1328
02:02:28,940 --> 02:02:31,340
Whatever you did...

1329
02:02:31,420 --> 02:02:34,330
...won't stop you from dying by my sword.

1330
02:02:35,640 --> 02:02:38,230
Do you think we don't know
about your plans?

1331
02:02:38,920 --> 02:02:40,460
Look at there.

1332
02:02:43,020 --> 02:02:45,180
Did you trust these, Olof?

1333
02:02:53,870 --> 02:02:55,960
Death is what cruels deserve!

1334
02:02:56,280 --> 02:02:58,840
Your end is to be hunted down!

1335
02:03:02,310 --> 02:03:05,290
Allah is mighty!
Allah is the greatest!

1336
02:03:28,440 --> 02:03:29,430
Olof!

1337
02:03:32,010 --> 02:03:34,410
Olof, we can't take it.

1338
02:03:37,640 --> 02:03:39,740
We must withdraw, Olof, come on!

1339
02:03:39,880 --> 02:03:40,730
No.

1340
02:03:42,140 --> 02:03:43,740
Come on Olof, your wound is deep!

1341
02:03:45,160 --> 02:03:46,380
Let's go!

1342
02:03:54,390 --> 02:03:56,570
No.
No!

1343
02:04:11,630 --> 02:04:13,560
Olof!

1344
02:04:15,750 --> 02:04:18,520
The sky might fell and the earth
might split open.

1345
02:04:19,190 --> 02:04:21,430
But there is no place
for you to hide.

1346
02:04:22,350 --> 02:04:24,600
I will be behind you like
the shadow of death.

1347
02:04:25,190 --> 02:04:27,260
You will not find rest in that
castle of yours!

1348
02:04:50,940 --> 02:04:52,030
Attack!

1349
02:05:21,960 --> 02:05:24,700
Game is over, Frigg.

1350
02:05:26,060 --> 02:05:27,880
Your life is in my hands.

1351
02:05:36,760 --> 02:05:38,810
Take this ignoble to the tribe!

1352
02:05:46,300 --> 02:05:47,980
How is going on with
the preparations?

1353
02:05:48,170 --> 02:05:51,500
Everyone is exercising
to ride horse.

1354
02:05:51,950 --> 02:05:56,870
Everyone will be able to fight,
Mother Sultan.

1355
02:05:57,180 --> 02:05:58,870
Preparations are going on.

1356
02:05:59,430 --> 02:06:00,470
Great.

1357
02:06:13,750 --> 02:06:14,810
Candar Bey.

1358
02:06:16,250 --> 02:06:17,830
Do you think of your homeland?

1359
02:06:18,570 --> 02:06:20,860
What else can a man think of, Mother Sultan?

1360
02:06:21,610 --> 02:06:24,750
Don't worry, your home is safe.

1361
02:06:25,900 --> 02:06:28,830
We'll beat that Nayman.

1362
02:06:37,020 --> 02:06:39,720
- Celale.
- Mother Sultan.

1363
02:06:40,310 --> 02:06:42,700
- There's a cavalry approaching.
- A cavalry?

1364
02:08:26,750 --> 02:08:28,950
I am the power of God!

1365
02:08:30,870 --> 02:08:31,820
Who are you?

1366
02:08:33,370 --> 02:08:36,820
I am a descendant of Genghis
and I will be the end of yours.

1367
02:08:37,240 --> 02:08:40,240
Nayman.

1368
02:09:27,320 --> 02:09:30,700
I've come from a
very long, long way

1369
02:09:52,810 --> 02:09:54,010
It's tasteless.

1370
02:09:59,180 --> 02:10:01,610
Just like your lands.

1371
02:10:03,470 --> 02:10:06,970
You claim that you will shed your blood
for the sake of these lands!

1372
02:10:07,740 --> 02:10:08,970
Ridiculous!

1373
02:10:13,800 --> 02:10:14,840
No

1374
02:10:19,150 --> 02:10:20,940
Let your leader come.

1375
02:10:22,630 --> 02:10:24,140
I am already here.

1376
02:10:24,490 --> 02:10:26,140
Shut up, woman.

1377
02:10:30,190 --> 02:10:32,270
I am talking about Osman.

1378
02:10:55,850 --> 02:10:57,550
No, Kumral Abdal, no.

1379
02:10:58,280 --> 02:10:59,550
I do not feel

1380
02:11:06,390 --> 02:11:08,040
Come on, come on

1381
02:11:09,070 --> 02:11:10,040
Let's go

1382
02:11:10,940 --> 02:11:12,230
Come on, one more time

1383
02:11:13,210 --> 02:11:15,720
Come on, come on, valiant.

1384
02:11:32,710 --> 02:11:34,710
Your biggest weakness...

1385
02:11:37,610 --> 02:11:40,500
...is that you are not choosing
your leader correctly

1386
02:11:45,770 --> 02:11:49,550
Mighty Genghis overcame many problems.

1387
02:11:51,550 --> 02:11:53,690
He was beaten and insulted.

1388
02:11:53,820 --> 02:11:56,670
So he became the leader.

1389
02:11:58,670 --> 02:12:01,310
What did Osman tell you?

1390
02:12:05,530 --> 02:12:09,260
He told you,
"Neman will deploy his armies, don't stand here."

1391
02:12:09,880 --> 02:12:11,260
What did you do?

1392
02:12:13,830 --> 02:12:15,500
You didn't care.

1393
02:12:20,300 --> 02:12:24,810
What I like most are
foolish enemies.

1394
02:12:25,900 --> 02:12:28,990
Easy booty
and lots of blood!

1395
02:12:32,870 --> 02:12:35,880
Osman was right.

1396
02:12:38,450 --> 02:12:42,210
A little bit of my army is here.

1397
02:12:42,370 --> 02:12:44,940
Because even
this is too much for you!

1398
02:12:46,810 --> 02:12:54,750
My armies sieged Candar's land.

1399
02:13:00,850 --> 02:13:07,470
The lands of Qarasi
is currently under siege.

1400
02:13:11,610 --> 02:13:13,970
Yakup Bey!

1401
02:13:15,860 --> 02:13:24,920
While your whole army is here,
Germiyan is a piece of cake for me.

1402
02:13:28,750 --> 02:13:30,850
How many soldiers are here?

1403
02:13:31,550 --> 02:13:33,900
Let's go out to the field.

1404
02:13:35,500 --> 02:13:38,260
My victory will not take long.

1405
02:13:38,880 --> 02:13:47,330
Because you became domasticated
in mansions and palaces.

1406
02:13:47,670 --> 02:13:51,890
But I am a hungry steppe wolf!

1407
02:13:54,330 --> 02:13:58,870
Do you think we're afraid, Nayman?

1408
02:14:01,200 --> 02:14:04,370
You are shaking, Mother Sultan.

1409
02:14:06,070 --> 02:14:09,690
I forgave your son Aladdin
for my interests.

1410
02:14:09,880 --> 02:14:14,920
But there is no reason
for me to let you live.

1411
02:14:19,160 --> 02:14:25,250
One hundred and fifty chests of gold

1412
02:14:25,840 --> 02:14:29,280
Your taxes will triple!

1413
02:14:30,150 --> 02:14:33,850
And you will give me
ten thousand horses.

1414
02:14:37,070 --> 02:14:42,350
You will dissolve your army here,
which is of no use

1415
02:14:52,980 --> 02:14:54,490
Hold on, son.

1416
02:14:55,200 --> 02:14:58,960
That's enough, I don't want to!

1417
02:15:00,340 --> 02:15:02,580
I can't move neither
my hands nor my feet!

1418
02:15:02,910 --> 02:15:05,070
I am dead!

1419
02:15:05,260 --> 02:15:07,880
This bed is my grave!

1420
02:15:08,210 --> 02:15:11,430
I can't hold the sword anymore!

1421
02:15:12,810 --> 02:15:15,300
You will, son!

1422
02:15:17,970 --> 02:15:22,550
You will hold the sword and
stand on your feet!

1423
02:15:24,490 --> 02:15:26,900
Do not give up!

1424
02:15:27,200 --> 02:15:30,770
What are you talking about, father?
Where are we going?

1425
02:15:31,090 --> 02:15:32,850
Osman.

1426
02:15:33,180 --> 02:15:37,340
- His treatment continues, my Bey.
- Osman, where are you taking Orhan?

1427
02:15:37,530 --> 02:15:38,940
Where are we going, father?

1428
02:15:39,070 --> 02:15:43,890
Lying time is over!
We'll get out of the tent first!

1429
02:15:48,790 --> 02:15:51,980
Father, don't do it, father!

1430
02:15:52,110 --> 02:15:54,360
I don't want them to see me like this.

1431
02:15:54,580 --> 02:15:56,310
No, son!

1432
02:15:57,790 --> 02:16:01,850
Being a Bey doesn't only require
being present on battlefields.

1433
02:16:02,100 --> 02:16:04,670
You will not be locked in the dark.

1434
02:16:05,040 --> 02:16:07,670
You will go out and see the light of day.

1435
02:16:09,160 --> 02:16:12,020
But we'll go to the training first!

1436
02:16:12,130 --> 02:16:17,300
You will leave neither
your sword nor your people.

1437
02:16:19,600 --> 02:16:21,870
But first

1438
02:16:45,000 --> 02:16:46,730
Son.

1439
02:16:47,790 --> 02:16:49,549
Come.

1440
02:16:49,760 --> 02:16:51,030
Come.

1441
02:17:31,910 --> 02:17:33,879
Son.

1442
02:17:55,420 --> 02:17:56,850
Son.

1443
02:18:02,100 --> 02:18:04,180
You will not give up.

1444
02:18:05,750 --> 02:18:07,808
You will not give up.

1445
02:18:09,480 --> 02:18:12,760
Giving up is forbidden to us.

1446
02:18:20,709 --> 02:18:23,340
Giving up is forbidden to us.

1447
02:19:09,080 --> 02:19:10,888
Now that you...

1448
02:19:17,870 --> 02:19:21,280
Now that you can't stand
up straight.

1449
02:19:21,770 --> 02:19:24,468
So we'll find another way.

1450
02:19:29,320 --> 02:19:32,100
If you have hope...

1451
02:19:33,750 --> 02:19:35,808
Son...

1452
02:19:43,790 --> 02:19:47,058
Then you will somehow stand up.

1453
02:19:47,740 --> 02:19:51,340
You'll get up somehow, son.

1454
02:19:53,740 --> 02:19:57,230
- Okay, Orhan?
- Okay, father.

1455
02:19:58,050 --> 02:20:02,080
- Okay, Orhan?
- Okay, father.

1456
02:20:04,060 --> 02:20:06,240
Praise be to my valiant!

1457
02:20:18,120 --> 02:20:20,170
My son Orhan

1458
02:20:22,690 --> 02:20:25,340
He can't walk right now.

1459
02:20:30,400 --> 02:20:37,140
Like the situation in our country

1460
02:20:38,110 --> 02:20:43,200
The oppressors have been
oppressing us for a long time!

1461
02:20:43,360 --> 02:20:51,120
But no, we will not wait and
we will not be defeated!

1462
02:20:52,230 --> 02:21:00,590
It's timeto rise up for both Orhan and
for our country!

1463
02:21:01,100 --> 02:21:09,680
- Allah is the greatest!
- Allah is the greatest!

1464
02:21:09,790 --> 02:21:16,170
My son Orhan, you will rise,
then our country will rise.

1465
